<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">YOH 44.Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mulumbe waina wa Yesu Klistu walalembwa ne Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yohane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mulumbe Waina wa Yesu Klistu walalembwa ne</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="imt">Bupandulushi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulumbe walalembwa ne Yohane ulambanga sha Yesu kuba Maswi a Lesa atapu, uyo walaba muntu nekwisa kwikala pakati petu, mbuli libuku ncelilambanga. Uwu mulembe walalembwa kwambeti balabelengenga bashometi Yesu eMupulushi Walaiwa Mwanendi Lesa, kwambeti kupitila mukumushoma bakacane buyumi (20:31)</para>
  <para style="ip">Pakutatikowa Maswi atapu alabonekelenga muli Yesu, cimpansha cakutanguna ca mulumbe cilambanga byeshikukankamanisha bingi bilaleshengeti Yesu e Mupulushi Walaiwa Mwanendi Lesa. Byakonkapo ni biyisho bingi bilasansululunga byeshikukankamanisha. Lubasu nalumbi lwalibuku ili lulambanga sha bantu balashoma nekumukonkela Yesu, kayi ne nabambi balamutoteka ne kukana kumushoma. Bimpansha (13-17) Bilambanga sha lwikatano lwa Yesu ne beshikwiya pa busuba bwakwikatwa, kayi ne maswi akulibambila, ne kubayuminisha pabusuba bwa kufwa kwkendi. Bimpansha byakupwililisha bilambanga sha kusunga ne komboloshewa, kupopwa, kupunduka, kayi nekubonekela kwakendi kuli beshikwiya panyuma pakupunduka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nkani ya mutukashi walekatwa kapombolwa 8:1-11 (Nkaniyi yalembwa mwafwekelelwa) Pakwinga mipukutu ingi yakaindi kayi nekutuntulula kwa kaindi muli nkani iyi sobwe. Nomba nabambi balaishamo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane lakonkomeshenga sha cipo ca buyumi butapu kupitila muli Klistu,ici ecipo cilipo lelo kuli bantu balatambulunga Yesu kuba Nshila, Cancinencine, ne Buyumi. Cintu cinene cilayandikinga ni kusebensesha bintu bilabonekenga, byeshibikwa kubantu mubwikalo bwabo, bwa busuba ne busuba, mbuli menshi, shinkwa, mumuni, mwembeshi ne mbelele shakendi, citondo ne bisepo, kukonkomesha pabilayandikinga pa buyumi bwabo bwkumushimu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Byakwambapo bingi (1:1-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohane Mubatishi ne beshikwiya batanshi ba Yesu 1:19-51</para>
  <para style="io1">Mulumbe wapantangalala wa Yesu 2:1 mpaka 12:50</para>
  <para style="io1">Masuba akupwililisha a Yelusalemu 13:1 mpaka 19:42</para>
  <para style="io1">Kupunduka ne kubonekela 20:1-31</para>
  <para style="io1">Kulayana kayi ne kubonekela mu Galileya 21:1-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Maswi alasunduka kuba muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <figure style="fig" desc="" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:1">Shimilumbo Waciyuda</figure>Pakutatika, kakuli kwabula bintu byonse kwalikuba Liswi, Liswi ili lyalikuba kuli Lesa. Kayi Liswi ili lyalikuba Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Liswi ili lyalikuba ne Lesa cindi conse. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Byonse byalabako kupitila mulyendiye, kayi kuliyawa cintu calabako kwabula endiye. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mulyendiye mwalikuba buyumi, kayi buyumi ubo ebwalikuba cinyina ca mumuni kubantu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mumuni uwu ulamunikinga mumushinshe, kayi mushinshe nkawalacikonsha kushima mumuni. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco Lesa walatuma muntu naumbi, lina lyakendi walikuba Yohane. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nendi uyu walesa kwinshila bukamboni, nekwambila bantu sha mumuni usa, kwambeti bantu bonse banyumfwe nekushoma. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nteko kwambeti nendi walikuba mumuni, nsombi walesa kuba kamboni wa mumuni. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mumuni wancine ncine, weshi kumunikila bantu bonse, walesa pacishi capanshi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walikuba pacishi capanshi, nomba bantu bapacishi capanshi baliya kumwinshiba, nambi Lesa walalenga bintu byonse kupitila mulyendiye. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Walesa kubantu bamushobo wakendi, nomba bantu bakendi baliya kumutambula. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Necikabeco nabambi balamutambula nekushoma lina lyakendi, kayi bopelaba walabapa ngofu shakuba bana ba Lesa <verse number="13" style="v"/>Neco Kuba bana ba Lesa kuliya kufuma mukusemwa kwabo, nambi mu kuyanda kwa mubili, nambi kwanda kwa muntu sobwe, sombi kwalafuma kuli Lesa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino Liswi lyalasanduka muntu, nekwisa kwikala pamo nenjafwe. Walikuba ne nkumbo kayi ne cancine ncine. Kayi twalabona bulemu bwakendi, bulemu mbwalatambula kuBaishi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yohane walamubela bukamboni. Walikwambila bantu mwangofu kwambeti, “Uyu engondalikwambeti, kuli lesanga panyuma pakame wampita, pakwinga nkantana nsemwa, nendi walikubapo.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Weco kupitila munkumbo shakendi shesula twense twalalelekwa mwakupwililila, kulelekwa kwakonkana konkana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lesa walatupa Milawo kupitila muli Mose, nomba inkumbo nekushomeka kwalesa kupitila muli Yesu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>kuliya muntu walamubonapo Lesa. Nsombi umo enka Lesa usa, wekala pamo neBaishi, ewalamuyubulula.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a Yohane Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateyo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:18">Maliko 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lino ubu ebukamboni mbwalapa Yohane kubamakulene baBayuda baku Yelusalemu balatuma beshimilumbo neba Levi nabambi kuyakwipusha Yohane, balamwipusheti “Njobe bani?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nendi walasumina cancine ncine nekubakumbula mwakubula kusoleka, “Ame ntame Mupulushi Walaiwa usa sobwe.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Balamwipusha kayi, “Nomba njobe Eliya?” Neye walambeti, “Sobwe, ntame Eliya.” Nabo balambeti, “Njobe Mushinshimi ngotulapembelelenga usa?” Neye Yohane walakumbuleti, “Sobwe ntame.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino twambile cancine ncine, kwambeti twenga tubapandulwile cena balatutumu. Omwine ukute kwambeti njobe bani? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yohane walabakumbuleti, mbuli mwalambila mushinshimi Yesaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ame njame liswi lya muntu lolobeshenga mucinyika;</para>
  <para style="q">Lambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">lulamikani nshila mwakupita Mwami.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino basa bantu balatumwa ne Bafalisi, <verse number="25" style="v"/>balamwipusha Yohane, “Na ntobe Mupulushi Walaiwa usa, nambi Eliya, nambi Mushinshimi ngotulapembelelenga usa, nomba nicani ulabatishinga bantu?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yohane walabakumbuleti, “Ame ndababatishinga ne menshi nsombi pakati penu apa pali umbi ngomutenshi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nendi uyu lesanga panyuma pakame, nkandelela nekuba musha wakendi wela kusungulula ntambo sha nkwabilo shakendi.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:27">Muntu wafwala nkwabilo</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Bintu ibi byalenshikila ku Betaniya, kutala lwa kucwe kwa mulonga waYolodani, uko Yohane nkwali kubatisha.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Mbelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mumene mene Yohane walabona Yesu kesa kulyendiye, lino walambeti, “Kamubonani Mwana Mbelele wa Lesa, weshikufunya bwipishi bwapacishi capanshi! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Uyu endiye usa ngondalikwambeti, ‘Panyuma pakame palesanga muntu wampita, pakwinga ame nkantanansemwa nendi walikubako.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nenjame nkandimwinshi, nomba ndalesa akubatisha ne menshi kwambeti Baislaeli bamwishibe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kayi Yohane walamwinshila bukamboni, pakwambeti, “Ndalabona Mushimu Uswepa kauseluka kwilu walikuboneketi nkulimba, walesa kwikala pali endiye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ame nkandali kumwinshiba, nsombi Lesa walantuma kwisa akubatisha ne menshi ewanjishibisha kwambeti, ‘Nubone Mushimu Uswepa wesanga kwikala palyendiye, epeloyo eshi kubatisha ne Mushimu Uswepa.’ ” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ame ndalabibona, kayi ndamwambilingeti, “Epele uyu Emwana waLesa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Beshikwiya bakutanguna ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mumene mene busuba bwalakonkapo Yohane walikuba pamusena popelapo pamo ne beshikwiya bambi babili. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mpwalabona Yesu kapita, walambeti, “Kamubonani Mwana mbelele wa Lesa!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Beshikwiya babili basa mpobalanyumfwa maswi alico, balamukonka Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalacebuka ne kuboneti balamukonkelenga, walabepusheti, “Nomba mulayandanga cani?” Nabo balambeti, “Tulayandanga kwinshiba mukute kwikala kupeyo, Labi? Bupandulushi bwa Labi nikwambeti, shikwiyisha.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti “Tiyeni mwenga mukubone.” Nabo balaya nendi. Nomba cindi calikuba mu ma 4 koloko mansailo mpobalayakubona nkwalikwikala, balekala kopeloko ubo busuba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Umo pali basa babili walanyumfwa maswi a Yohane ne kumukonka Yesu, walikuba Ndileya mukwabo Shimoni Petulo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mpwalamucana shimoni mukwabo, walamwambileti, “Tulamucana Klistu, Mupulushi Walaiwa.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Neco walamumanta ne kuya nendi kuli Yesu. Yesu mpwalamulangishisha walambeti, “Njobe Shimoni, mwanendi Yohane, nomba lino Lina lyakobe nube Kefa.” Bupandulushi bwa maina Kefa ne Petulo, alambangeti libwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakunga Filipo ne Nataniyele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca Yesu walayeya shakuya ku Galileya. Walacana Filipo, ne kumwambileti, “Unkonke.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Filipo walikuba waku munshi wa Betsaida, kucomwabo Ndileya ne Petulo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Filipo walacana Nataniyele ne kumwambileti, “Tulamucana usa Mose ngwalalemba sha endiye mulibuku lya Milawo, usa bashinshimi ngobalalemba sha endiye. Yesu Mwana waYosefe, waku Nasaleti.” <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nomba Nataniyele walamwipusheti, “Sena kuNasaleti ngakufuma kantu kayina?” Filipo walakumbuleti, “Tiye ulibonene wenka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalamubona Nataniyele nkesa, walambeti, “Cakubinga uyu emwana mwine mwine waku Islayele wabula bundengamano.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nataniyele walamwipusheti, “Mulanjishibi aconi?” Yesu walakumbuleti, “Pasa mpowanga wekala mwinshi mwacitondo camukuyu, Filipo katana akukuwa, ame ndalakubona.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nataniyele walambeti, “Bashikwiyisha, cakubinga njamwe Mwana Lesa, njamwe Mwami wa Islayele.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Sena ulashomo pakwinga ndakwambilyeti ndalakubona mwinshi mwa citondo camukuyu. Nomba nubone byapita apa.” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kayi walambeti, “Lino cancine ncine ndakwambilingeti nukabone kwilu kwacaluka, nukabone bangelo ba Lesa nkabatanta kayi kabaseluka kwisa kuli Mwana Muntu.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bwinga bwa ku Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpopalapita masuba abili, kwalaba bwinga ku Kana munshi walikuba mucimpansha ca Galileya. Nabo banyina Yesu balayako. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu neye pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi balakwiwako kubwinga ubu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mpowalapwa waini ngobalikunwa bantu, banyina Yesu balamwambileti, “Ulabapwili waini.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Ma kamutang'ambila ncendela kwinsa, Cindi cakame nkacitana cishika.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Necikabeco banyina balambila basebenshi bapabwingeti, “Mwinse ciliconse nceti amwambile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino popelapo palikuba nongo sha mabwe shisanu ne imo, balashibikapo pacebo ca mwambo wa Bayuda wakuliswepesha. Munongo iliyonse mwalikwingila menshi akwana mingomo isanu nambi kupitililapo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambila basa basebenshi, “Kamushani menshi munongo shonse shisule.” Naboyo balesusha mpaka pamilomo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi walabambileti, “Lino tekulani, mutwalile mukulene lendeleshenga bwinga.” Naboyo balamutwalila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mukulene wa bwinga mpwalatelela menshi asa Yesu ngalasandula kuba waini, liya kwinshiba kwalafuma waini uyo. Nomba basebenshi basa balateka menshi balikwinshiba. Lino mukulene walikwendelesha bwinga walakuwa shibwinga, <verse number="10" style="v"/>ne kumwambileti, “Bantu bakute kutanguna kuyaba waini waina, nomba bantu bekuta, ukute kubapa waini waina pang'ana. Nomba amwe mwanga mwabika waina kushika cino cindi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ici calikuba cishikunkamanisha cakutanguna Yesu ncalensa mumunshi wa Kana mucimpansha ca Galileya nkwalalesha bulemu bwakendi, neco beshikwiya bakendi balamushoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walaya ku Kapenao, pamo ne banyina ne bakwabo ne beshikwiya bakendi, nkobalakekala kwamasuba ang'ana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lenga ku Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mateyo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Cindi ca kusekelela Pasika wa Bayuda calaba pepi, Yesu walanyamuka kuya kuYelusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kopeloko walengila mulubuwa lwa Ng'anda ya Lesa walakacana bantu balolishinga ng'ombe, mbelele ne nkulimba. Kayi nabambi kabali bekala pa bipuna kabashintana mali.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:14">Shimakwebo lashintanishinga mali</figure> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Popelapo walapanga ciswepu ca loshi ne kutatika kubatandanyina pansa bonse, pamo ne ngombe, ne mbelele shabo shonse. walawisha matebulu a bantu balikushintana mali ne mali alamwaikila panshi mbwee. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kayi walambila balikulisha nkulimba eti, “Bipulisheni pansa, mutaisandula Ng'anda ya Bata kuba ya kwinshilamo makwebo.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Beshikwiya balanuka Mabala alambangeti, “Kulibenga kwakame mung'anda yenu kulyeti mulilo ulabangilinga mukati mwakame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Popelapo bamakulene ba Bayuda balamwipusheti, “Nicikankamiko cini ncoshi winse kwambeti utuleshe naukute ngofu shakwinsa bintu ibi?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Na mwipwaye Nga'nda ya Lesa ino, nenjame nindiyibake mumasuba atatu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino nabo balambeti, “Nga'nda ya Lesa iyi yalamanta byaka makumi ana ne byaka bisanu ne cimo pakuibaka, lino amwe ngamuibaka mumasubowa atatu?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba Ng'anda ya Lesa njalikwamba Yesu walikuba mubili wakendi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mpwalapunduka kubafu, beshikwiya bakendi balanuka kwambeti walabambilapo makani awa, neco balashoma Mabala ne maswi ngalamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu winshi bantu bonse ncobabele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikuba mu Yelusalemu pakusekelela kwa Pasika, bantu bangi balamushoma pakubona bikankamisho mbyalensa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu liya kubashoma, pakwinga walikubenshiba ncebabele bonse. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nkalapembela kwambeti muntu umbi amwambile ncebabele bantu, pakwinga mwine walikwinshiba bili mumyoyo ya bantu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Muntu wamulikoto lya Bafalisi, lina lyakendi Nikodemo, mutangunishi wa Bayuda, <verse number="2" style="v"/>walesa kuli Yesu mashiku ne kwambeti, “Bashikwiyisha, tucinsheti njamwe shikwiyisha ngwalatutumina Lesa, pakwinga kuliya muntu wela kwinsa bingashilo byeshikukankamanisha mbyomulenshinga, na Lesa nkalipo nendi.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Cancine ndakwambilinga kuliya muntu wela kwingila mubwami bwa Lesa na liya kusemwa cipya.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nikodemo walepusheti, “Sena muntu ngosemwa kayi cipya lakulu kendi? Sena ngawingila mulibunda mubanyina ne kusemwa cipya?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Ndakwambilinga cancine ncine kwambeti kotana wingila mu Bwami bwa Lesa citanshi kusemwa ne menshi ne Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Muntu ukute kusemwa kumubili, nsombi kumushimu ukute kusemwa ne Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kotakankamana pakwinga ndakwambilyeti wela kusemwa katubili. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lukupwe lukute kupupula kulubasu kulikonse, kayi mukute kunyumfweti lulapupulunga, nsombi nkokute kwinshiba nkolulafumunga nambi nkolulenga. Nicimo cimo ne muntu uliyense lasemwa ne Mushimu Uswepa.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nikodemo walepusheti, “Ibi ngabinshika aconi?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Sena obe ntobe shikwiyisha wenshibikwa mu islayeli, nomba nkobinshi aconi bintu ibi?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ndakwambilinga cancine ncine tukute kwamba mbyotwinshi, kayi tukute kupa bukamboni mbyotwalabona, nomba amwe nkamulashomonga maswi etu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na nkamulashomonga mpondamwambilinga byapanshi pano, nomba ngamushoma aconi ndamwambila bintu byakwilu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kuliya muntu walayako kwilu, nsombi Mwana Muntu ewalesa kufuma kwilu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba kayi mbuli Mose mucinyika musa walapacika njoka ya mukuba pelu pacitondo, copeleco neye Mwana Muntu nakanyamunwe pelu mushobomo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwambeti uliyense wamushoma akabe ne buyumi butapu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kayi Lesa walabasunisha bantu pacishi capanshi, ecebo cakendi walayaba Mwanendi umo enka, kwambeti uliyense eti akamushome akacane buyumi butapu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lesa nkalatuma Mwanendi panshi pano, kwambeti omboloshe milandu ya bantu, nsombi kwambeti abapulushe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Namuntu washoma muli Yesu, Lesa nteshi akamomboloshe, nsombi abo balabulunga kushoma balomboloshewanga kendi, pakwinga nkabalashomonga Mwana wa Lesa enka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lombolosho nulu lwakwambeti nekukabeti mumuni walesa pacishi capanshi bantu balasuna mushinshe, kupita mumuni pakwinga incito shabo shaipa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Uliyense lenshinga byaipa, wapatana ne mumuni. Kayi nkakute kwisa patuba, kutina incito shakendi shaipa kwambeti ngashibonekela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nsombi balenshinga byancine ncine bakute kwisa patuba, kayi bya kwinsa byabo bikute kwinshibiketi labinshi mwakunyumfwila Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yohane Mubatishi lambanga sha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi, Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balaya ku cimpansha caYudeya. Walekala nabo kwacindi citali kopeloko kabatisha bantu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Neye Yohane walikubatisha ku Ainoni pepi ne Salimu, pakwinga ekwalikuba menshi angi. Bantu balikushika kulyendiye, walikubabatisha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pacindici Yohane walikatana uwalwa mujele. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bambi baYohane balatatika kutototekeshana ne Muyuda naumbi shamwambo wakuliswepesha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Neco beshikwiya basa balesa kuli Yohane ne kumwambileti, “Mwiyi bonani, muntu usa ngomwalikwamba nendi kutala kwa mulonga wa Yolodani, usa ngomwalenshila bukamboni neye labatishinga, kayi bantu bonse balafwambilinga kulyendiye.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yohane walakumbuleti, “Muntu nkela kutambula kantu kalikonse na Lesa liya kumupa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Amwe ngamumbela bukamboni pakwinga mwalanyumfwa ndalambeti, Ntame Mupulushi Walaiwa, nsombi njame walatumwa pantangu pakendi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nyabwinga nimuka shibwinga. Nomba munendi nyabwinga emanapepi kanyumfwako ukute kukondwa anyumfwa maswi ashibwinga. Nicimo cimo nenjame kukondwa kwakame kulakwana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Usa welela kuba ne bulemu bunene bwapita bwakame.”</para>
  <para style="s">Sha Yesu weshikufuma kwilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yohane 1:20</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:23">23</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Weshikufuma kwilu wapita bonse. Weshikufuma panshi pano niwapanshi pano, kayi ukute kwamba bya panshi pano. Weshikufuma kwilu wapita bonse. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nendi uyu lenshinga bukamboni pa bintu mbyalabona ne kunyumfwa, nsombi paliya ukute kushoma maswi akendi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nsombi muntu ashoma maswi akendi, ukute kulesheti Lesa ukute kukwanilisha malayano akendi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Uyo Lesa ngwalatuma, ukute kwamba maswi a Lesa, pakwinga Lesa ukute kumupa Mushimu Uswepa wabula cipimo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bata bamusuni mwanabo, kayi babika bintu byonse mumakasa akendi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muntu lashomonga mwanoyo, ukute buyumi butapu. Nsombi lakananga kushoma mwanoyo, nteshi akabe nebuyumi, neco bukalu bwa Lesa buli palyendiye cindi conse.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Mutukashi wa ku Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bafalisi balanyumfweti Yesu lasandulunga bantu bangi kuba beshikwiya ne kubabatisha kupita Yohane, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu uliya kubatishapo muntu naba umo, nsombi beshikwiya bakendi ebalikubatisha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalenshiba ncebalikwamba, walafumako kuYudeya ne kubwelela ku Galileya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pabulwendo bwakendi walaciboneti welela kupitila mucishi ca Samaliya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino walashika ku munshi waku Samaliya, walikukwiweti Sika, pepi ne kamusena ako Yakobo nkalapa Yosefe mwanendi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kopeloko kwalikuba mukalo walikuba waYakobo. Yesu walekala panshi pambali pamukalo uyo, pakwinga walikuba laleme nemusuma. Cindi calikuba muma 12 koloko munshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mutukashi wa kuSamaliya walesakuteka menshi. Yesu walamusengeti, “kamumpako menshi akunwa.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pacindi ico beshikwiya bakendi balikuba balayi akula cakulya mumunshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mutukashi usa walakumbuleti, “Amwe Bayuda, nicani mulasengenga menshi kuli nde Musamaliya?” Pakwinga Bayuda nkabendelana ne Basamaliya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Nkocishi cipo Lesa ncalayandanga kukupa, kayi nkomwinshi lakusengenga menshi akunwa, numwinshi nshinga nulamusenge menshi eshikupa buyumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mutukashi uyo walambeti, “Nkambo, muliyawa cakutekesha, kayi mukalo uyu nutali, nomba menshi eshikupa buyumi ayo nimwafunye kupeyo? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sena amwe mwapita bata bakulukulu balikubako ba Yakobo? uyo walashiya mukalo uyu ngalikunwamo mwine ne bana bendi kayi ne biswika byakendi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Muntu uliyense lanunga menshi aya nakanyumfwe inyotwa kayi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nsombi uliyense uyo lanunga menshi ngondamupa nteshi akanyumfwepo inyotwa kayi. Pakwinga menshi ayo ngoshi nkamupe nakabeti kamulonga kansansa menshi eshikupa buyumi butapu.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mutukashi uyo walambeti, “Nkambo, kamumpako ayo menshi kwambeti ntakanyumfwapo nyotwa nambi ntakesa kayi kuno akuteka menshi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Koya ukuwe baibobe mwise,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mutukashi uyo walambeti, “Ndiyawa mulume.” Yesu walakumbuleti, “Ulambanga cakubinga uliyawa mulume. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Obe walebwapo kendi kubatuloba basanu, kayi mutuloba ngoli nendi lino nte ibobe, mutukashi walambeti, mulamba cakubinga.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mutukashi walambeti, “Nkambo, ndacinshibi kwambeti njamwe Mushinshimi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bamashali betu bakulukulu balikupaila Lesa pa mulundu uyu, nsombi amwe Bayuda mukute kwambeti kuYelusalemu ekwelela kupailila.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Koshoma ncendambanga.” Cindi nicikashike nceshi mukabule kupailila Bata pa mulundu pano, nambi kuYelusalemu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Basamaliya mukute kupaila ngo mutenshi, afwe Bayuda tukute kupaila ngotwinshi, pakwinga lupulusho nilukacanike kupitila mu Bayuda. <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Nomba cindi nicikashike, kayi cilashiki kendi, bantu beshikupaila Cancine ncine mpoti bakapaile Bata mu Mushimu nemu cancine ncine. Bata bakute kuyanda bantu beshikumupaila mumushoboyo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lesa ni Mushimu, neco beshikumupaila bela kumupaila mu Mushimu ne mu Cancine ncine.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mutukashi usa walambeti, “Ndicinsheti Klistu Mupulushi Walaiwa lakesanga, akashika, nakatwambile byonse.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Ame ngolambanga nendi njame wopeloyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco beshikwiya ba Yesu balashika, nomba balakankamana mpobalacana kabandika ne mutukashi. Paliya walamwipusheti, “Ulayandanga cani” Nambi, “Nicani mulabandikinga nendi?” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mutukashi usa walashiya mungomo wakendi ne kuya mu munshi akwambila bantu, <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Katuyani mubone muntu lang'ambili byonse mbyondalensa. Sena ngakali usa Mupulushi Walaiwa? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lino bantu balayoboloka kufuma mumunshi kwisa kuli Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco beshikwiya ba Yesu balamusengeti, “Mwiyi, kamulyani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nendi walakumbuleti, “Ame nkute cakulya amwe ncomutenshi.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Popelapo beshikwiya balatatika kwipushana, “Sena kuli naumbi lamuletele cakulya?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walambeti, “Cakulya cakame nikwinsa ibyo mbyasuni Lesa walantuma ne kupwisha mulimo wakendi.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mukute kwambeti, pakati pakushanga ne kutebula pali myenshi ina nambi ingi, nsombi kamulangishisha bishango bilapi kendi, bilapembelengowa kutebula. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Musebenshi shikutebula latatiki kendi kufola, kayi labunganyanga bisepo kubuymi butapu. Neco shikushanga ne shikutebula nibakakondwe pamo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Neco mwambo wakwambeti, “Nabambi bakute kushanga, kayi nabambi bakute kwisa kutebula niwakubinga.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ndamutumunga kuya kutebula bishango mumabala alalimwa kendi ne bantu bambi. Amwe mulacaninipo pindu pa ncito yabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Basamaliya bangi ba mumunshi musa balamushoma Yesu pacebo cabukamboni bwa mutukashi usa, bwakwambeti, “nendi langambili byonse mbyondalensa.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lino Basamaliya mpobalashika kuli Yesu, balamusengeti ekale nabo. Neco walekala kopeloko masuba abili. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Popelapo bantu bangi balashoma pacebo ca maswi ngobalanyumfwa kuli Yesu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Usa mutukashu balamwambileti, “Tulashomo lino, tuliya kushoma pacebo ca maswi akobe, nsombi pacebo cakwambeti tulalinyumfwili tobene. Tulenshibi cakubinga kwambeti uyu eMupulushi wa bantu ba pacishi capanshi conse.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lashilikinga mwana wa mukulene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mateyo 8:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nomba mpopalapita masuba abili, Yesu walafumako nekuya ku Galileya. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu mwine walambeti, “mushinshimi, nkakute kupewa bulemu kucomwabo.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mpwalashika kuGalileya, bantu balamutambula, pakwinga balabonapo kendi byonse mbyalensa pakusekelela Pasika ku Yelusalemu pakwinga naboyo balikubako.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kufumapo Yesu walaya kumunshi wa kana ku Galileya, kusa nkwalasandula menshi kuba waini. Kopeloko kwalikuba mukulene wamfulumende ku Kapelenaumu walikukute mwana mulwashi. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mpalanyumfweti Yesu lashiki kuGalileya kufuma kuYudeya, walesa kulyendiye nekumusengeti enga nendi ku Kapelenaumu, kwambeti enga ashilike mwanendi walikuba pepi kufwa. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “wabula kubona bingashilo ne bikankamanisho, nkamushomo sobwe.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Mukulene wa mfulumende walambeti, “Nkambo, katuyani pamo mwaname nkatanafwa.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Koya mwanobe lasenguku kendi.” Muntuyo walashoma maswi a Yesu nekuya kucomwabo. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mpwalikuya walakumana ne basebenshi bakendi, nabo balamwambileti, “Mwanenu laba cena.” <verse number="52" style="v"/>Walabepusha cindi ncalaba cena mwanoyo, nabo balambeti, “Watatika kunyumfwa cena lilo munshi muma 1 koloko.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Lino baishi mwana balanuketi ecindi Yesu mpwalabambileti, “Mwanobe lasenguku.” Neco bonse bamung'anda yakendi balamushoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ici calikuba cingashilo cacibili ncalensa ku Kana, wa kuGalileya mpwalafuma ku Yudeya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lasengulunga mutuloba mulwashi ku betsaida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi kwalikuba kusekelela kwa Bayuda, ku Yelusalemu neye Yesu walayako <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino kopeloko pepi necishinga cambelele, kwalikuba kalishiba ka menshi kalikukwiweti Betsaida mumbali mwalishiba ili mwalikuba mwebakwa tumanda tubili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mu tumandomo mwalikona bantu bangi balwashi, balema ne bashipilwa kayi ne bakokonyana mibili <verse number="4" style="v"/>(Pakwinga mungelo walikufandaula menshi, neco mulwashi walikwingila bwangu mumenshi walikushilikwa.) <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba pa bantu balwashi abo palikuba umbi walakolwa kwa byaka 38. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalamubona nkali wona, waleshiba kwambeti walakolwa kwa cindi citali. Lino walamwipusheti, “Sena ulayandanga kushilikwa?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mulwashi uyo walambeti, “Nkambo ndiyawa muntu welakuntwala mumenshi na alafundaulwa, ndambeti njingile nkutekucana naumbi lampitili kendi.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Punduka, manta mpasa yakobe, yamba kwenda.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Popelapo muntu uyo walashilikwa, walamanta mpasa yakendi nekuyamba kwenda.</para>
  <para style="p">Busuba ubo bwalikuba bwa Sabata. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino Bayuda balambila uyu walashilikwa, “Lelo nipa Sabata, milawo yetu nkayasuminisha kunyamuna mpasa yakobe.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba neye walambeti, “Lanshiliki elangambilyeti, ‘Nyamuna mpasa yakobe nekwenda.’” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nabo balamwipusheti, “Niyani uyo lakwambily eti nyamuna mpasa yakobe wende?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba uyu muntu walashilikwa nkalamwinshiba walamushilikwa, pakwinga Yesu walikuba lengili mukati mwa bantu bangi abo balikuba popelapo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walamucana mu Nga'nda ya Lesa, usa ngwalashilika, walamwambileti, “Bona, lino ulashilikwa, kotakensa kayi byaipa, kwambeti nkotakakolwa kayi bulwashi nabumbi bwaipa.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Muntu usa walaya kwambila Bayuda kwambeti Yesu elamushiliki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino batangunishi ba Bayuda balatatika kumushupa Yesu pacebo cakushilika muntu pa Sabata. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walabambileti, “Bata balasebensenga cindi conse mpaka lelo lino, nenjame ndelela kusebensa.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Makani aya alapesheti bayuda bapitilishe kupingila kushina Yesu. Balikwambeti Yesu lapwayanga mulawo wa Sabata, kayi pakwambeti ni mwana wa Lesa, walyelanishinga ne Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Bwendeleshi bwa Mwanendi Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambeti, “Ndamwambilinga cancine ncine kwambeti paliya ncela kwinsa Mwana palwakendi mwine. Nsombi ukute kwinsa ncalabononga baishi nkabensa. Bilenshinga baishi neye Mwana mbyakute kwinsa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pakwinga baishi basuni Mwana, neco bakute kumulesha byonse nabo mbyobalenshinga. Baishi nibamuleshe mulimo wapita ibi kwambeti mubinshibe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mbuli Bata ncobakute kupundusha bafwa, nekubapa buyumi, copeleco Mwana lapanga buyumi kuli abo mbasuni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Baishi nkabakute kombolosha muntu sobwe. Nsombi balapa ngofu Mwana kwambeti abe weshikombolosha byonse. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bata bakute kuyandeti bantu bonse balemekenga Mwana, mbuli ncobakute kulemeka Baishi. Muntu labulunga kulemeka Mwana, nkakute kulemeka Baishi balamutuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ndamwambilishingeti muntu uliyense lanyumfu maswi akame nekushoma walantuma, nakabe ne buyumi butapu. Uyo nendi nteshi akomboloshewe, nsombi lapulu kendi mu lufu, nekuya mubuyumi butapu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kayi ndamwambilingeti cindi nicikashike, kayi cilashiki kendi, apo bantu bafwa mposhi bakanyumfwe maswi a Mwana wa Lesa, kayi abo beshibakanyumfwe ne bakashome nibakabe ne buyumi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mbuli baishi ncebalicitente ca buyumi nendi Mwana walaba citente cabuyumi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Neco walamupa mwana ngofu shakombolosha bantu, pakwinga ni Mwana Muntu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mutakankamana, pakwinga cindi nicikashike bantu bonse bali mumanda nibakanyumfwe maswi akendi nekupunduka. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bantu balensa byaina nibakapunduke kwambeti babe ne buyumi, nsombi balensa byaipa, nibakapunduke kwambeti bomboloshewe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bukamboni bwa pali Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Ame nkandela kwinsa kantu pandenka. Nkute kombolosha mbuli ncobakute kung'ambila Bata. Kayi nkute kombolosha mubululami, pakwinga nkankute kwinsa mbyonsuni, nsombi mbyobasuni Bata balantuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Na ndalinshili bukamboni, bukamboni bwakame nkabwakwana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nsombi kuli naumbi ukute kunjinshila bukamboni, kayi bukamboni mbwakute kunjinshila nibwancine ncine. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Amwe mwalatuma ntumi kuli Yohane mubatishi, nendi walensa bukamboni bwakubinga. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nteko kwambeti ame nsuni bukamboni bwa muntu, nsombi ndambanga ibi kwambeti amwe mupuluke. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yohane mubatishi walikubeti lampi yalikumunika, amwe mwalakondwa ne mumuni kwakacindi kang'ana. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nsombi ame nkute bukamboni bwapita bwa Yohane. Bata balampa incito njondelela kwinsa, kayi incito njondenshinga iyi ilaleshengeti Bata ebalantuma. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kayi Bata abo balantuma, balanjinshila bukamboni. Nomba amwe muliya kunyumfwa maswi abo, nambi kubona cinso cabo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Maswi abo nkakute kwikala muli njamwe, pakwinga nkamukute kumushoma Bata ngobalatuma. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mukute kubelenga Mabala a Lesa, pakwinga mukute kuyeyeti nimucanemo buyumi butapu. Nomba kayi Mabala opelayo akute kunjinshila bukamboni. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nomba amwe mulakananga kwisa kuli njame kwambeti mube ne buyumi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Nkandalangaulunga kupewa bulemu kubantu sobwe. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nsombi ndimwinshi kwambeti amwe nkamusuni Lesa mumyoyo yenu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ame ndalesa mulina lya Bata, nomba amwe muliya kuntambula. Nsombi umbi esa mulina lyakendi ne kulyamba mwine uyo engomukute kutambula. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Lino nomba nga mushomaconi na musuni owa kulumbaishiwa ne banenu, Nsombi nkamusuni kutambula bulemu mbwela kumupa Lesa? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nomba mutayeyeti njame ndeshi nkamwambilenga byaipa kuli Bata. Weshi akamwambilenga nkwali, Mose ngomwalikuba mwashoma. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ne mwalashoma Mose cancine ncine ne mwalanshoma ne njame, pakwinga neye walalemba makani alikwamba njame. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nomba na nkamulashomonga mbyalalemba, nomba ngamushoma aconi maswi akame?”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalyeshenga likoto linene lya bantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13">Mateyo 14:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walatampuka lwenje lwa Galileya ulo kayi lwalikukwiweti lwenje lwa Tibeliyo <verse number="2" style="v"/>Likoto linene lyalamukonkela, pacebo cakwambeti lyalabona bingashilo byeshi kukankamanisha mbyalensa pakushilika balwashi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walatanta mulundu ne kwikala panshi ne beshikwiya bakendi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lino kusekelela kwa Pasika kwalaseng'ena pepi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalalangishisha, walabona likoto lyabantu linene lisa nkalisa kulyendiye. Lino nendi walepusha Filipo, “Sena ngatuya tula kupeyo cakulya cakulyesha bantu bonse aba?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Walepushila nsulo kwambeti amweleshe Filipo, nsombi mwine walikwinshiba cakwinsa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Filipo walakumbuleti, “Nambi mali akwana masauzande ali 200 nkelakukwana kula cakulya cakwambeti uliyense alyeko nambi pang'ana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Weshikwiya wakendi umbi, lina lyakendi Ndileya, mukwabo Shimoni Petulo, walambila Yesu eti, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Pali mutuloba pano, ukute shinkwa usanu ne tunswi tubili. Nomba sena ngatukwana bantu bonse aba?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Bambileni bantu bekale panshi.” Popelapo palikuba mila yamwemfu ingi, nabo bantu abo balekala panshi. Batuloba bonka balikubapo balikuba bakwana 5,000. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino walamanta shinkwa usa, mpwalalumba Lesa, walabayabila bantu abo balikuba bekala panshi. Walensa copeleco ne tunswi tusa, nekubayabila bantu abo mobalikuyandila. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bantu bonse abo mpobalekuta, Yesu walambila Beshikwiya bakendi, “Yowelani byashalanga panshi kwambeti kabitatayanikowa.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba balayowela byonse bya shinkwa usanu usa, ne kwisusha mitanga likumi ne ibili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bantu basa mpobalabona ceshikukankamanisha ncalensa Yesu, balambeti, “Cancine ncine uyu nimushinshimi usa ngobalikwambeti nakese panshi pano.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu walenshiba kwambeti bantu abo balikuyandeti bamwikate ne kumubika pabwami cakumukakatisha. Neco walaya kayi kumulundu kwayenka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lendenga pa menshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-27">Mateyo 14:22-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mansailo, beshikwiya ba Yesu balaya ku Lwenje. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kopeloko balengila mubwato kwambeti batampuke lwenje kuya ku Kapelenaumu. Kwalashipa Yesu nkatana uya kulyendibo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pacindici kwalikuba cipuupu cinene, neco palaba mankape pa menshi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Beshikwiya mpobalendako makilomita akwana atatu nambi ana, balabona Yesu nkenda pa menshi nkesa pepi kubwato bwabo, neco nabo balatina. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walambeti, “Njame, mutatina.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino balikuyandeti engile mubwato nomba pacindi copeleco bwato bwalashika kutala kwa Lwenje nkobalikuya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino mumene mene likoto lya bantu lyalashalila kutala kwa lwenje, lyalenshiba kwambeti panga bwato bumo. Kayi bantu balenshiba kwambeti Yesu liya kwingilamo mubwato ubo beshikwiya bakendi balaya bonka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino mato nambi alafumina ku Tibeliyasi alashika pepi ne busena bantu basa mpobalyela cakulya Mwami mpalalumba Lesa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Likoto lisa lyalaboneti Yesu kuliya, nabo beshikwiya bakendi kuliya, bantu bonse basa balengila mubwato busa, nekuya ku kapelenaumu akuyandaula Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu eshinkwa wabuyumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mpobalamucana Yesu kutala kwa lwenje, balamwipusheti, “Bashikwiyisha, mwalashika lilyoni kuno?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Kwamba cakubinga, amwe mwanangaulanga pacebo cakwambeti mwalalya cakulya nekwikuta, nteko kwambeti mwalanyumfwishisha bikankamanisho bisa ncebyalikwamba sobwe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kamutasebensanga kwambeti mucane cakulya cikute konongeka, nsombi musebensenga kwambeti mucane cakulya ceshikwikalilila, buyumi butapu. Mwana Muntu endiye wela kumupa cakulya copeleci, pakwinga Lesa Bata mpobalabika cinshibilo ca kusuminisha kwabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nabo balamwipusheti, “Twinse aconi kwambeti tukonke mbyalayandanga Lesa?” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Lesa ncalayandanga kwambeti mwinse nikushoma ame ndalatumwa ne Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kayi balamwipusheti, “Ningamutubonesha cingashilo camushobo cini kwambeti twacibona tumushome? Nimwinsepo cani? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bashali betu bali kulya mana mucinyika musa, mbuli Mabala a Lesa ncalambangeti, ‘walikubapa cakulya ceshi kufuma kwilu kwambeti balye.’” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga kwambeti nte Mose walikubapa cakulya calikufuma kwilu sobwe, nsombi ni Bata. Mbuli Bata ncabalamupanga cakulya cancine ncine pacino cindi cilafumunga kwilu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pakwinga cakulya Lesa ncakute kupa, endico ceshikufuma kwilu, ceshikupa buyumi kubantu bonse ba mucishi capanshi.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Popelapo balambeti, “Mwami, kamutupanga cakulya ici masuba onse.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Njame shinkwa ceshikupa buyumi. Uliyense lesanga kuli njame nekunshoma nteshi akanyumfwe nsala. Kayi uliyense lashomonga njame, nteshi akanyumfwe nyotwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mbuli ncondalamwambileti kumbona mulambononga, nsombi nkamulashomonga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Abo bonse mbobampa bata, nibakese kuli njame, nomba muntu uliyense lesanga kuli njame, nteshi nkamukane. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pakwinga ndalafuma kwilu kwisakwinsa kuyanda kwa uyo walantuma, kutambeti njinse kuyanda kwakame sobwe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuyanda kwa uyo walantuma nikwambeti mbule kutaya nambi umo pali abo mbalampa, nsombi kwambeti nkabapundushe kubafu pabusuba bwakupwililisha. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pakwinga Bata ncobalayandanga nikwambeti muntu uliyense lamubono Mwanoyo nekumushoma, akabe ne buyumi butapu. Kai ame ninkamupundushe kufuma kubafu pabusuba bwa kupwililisha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Popelapo Bayuda nabambi balatatika kung'unung'usha cebo cakwambeti Yesu walambeti, “Ame njame shinkwa walafuma kwilu.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pacebo ici balambeti, “Se uyu nte Yesu mwanendi Yosefe usa? Baishi ne banyina tubenshi. Nomba nicani lambangeti, Ndalafuma kwilu?” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Mutang'unung'ushanga pakati penu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Paliya wela kwisa kuli njame, nsombi Bata balantuma ebelakumuleta kuli njame. Nomba na ucikonsha kwisa kulinjame ninkamupundushe kubafu pabusuba bwa kupwililisha. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bashinshimi balalembeti, ‘Lesa nakamwiyishe muntu uliyense.’ Pakwinga muntu uliyense lanyumfwilinga Bata, nekwiya kulyendibo, ukute kwisa kuli njame. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ici nkacilapandululungeti pali muntu walababonapo Bata sobwe, nsombi uyo enka walafuma kuli Lesa ewalababona. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubingeti uyo lanshomonga ukute buyumi butapu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ame njame shinkwa ceshikupa buyumi. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Bashali benu balikulya mana mucinyika musa, nikukabeco balafwa. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nomba shinkwa uwu walafuma kwilu, muntu aulya nteshi akafwe. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ame ndeshinkwa weshikupa buyumi walafuma kwilu. Na muntu uliyense ulya shinkwa uwu, nakabe nebuyumi butapu. Shinkwa weshinkamupe nimubili wakame, ngoshi nkape kwambeti bantu bonse bapacishi capanshi babe nebuyumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Popelapo Bayuda basa balatatika kutotekeshana bonka, kabambeti, “Ngatulya aconi mubili wakendi?” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga, Na mubula kulya mubili wa Mwana Muntu nekunwa milopa yakendi, nkamwela kuba nebuyumi muli njamwe. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Uliyense lalinga mubili wakame nekunwa milopa yakame, ukute buyumi butapu, ame ninkamupundushe kubafu pa busuba bwa kupwililisha. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Pakwinga mubili wakame shinkwa wacancine ncine, kayi milopa yakame ecakunwa cancine ncine. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Uliyense lalinga mubili wakame nekunwa milopa yakame ukute kwikala mulinjame, nenjame nkute kwikala mulyendiye. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Mbuli Bata bayumi balantuma, kayi nenjame ndemuyumi pakuba mulyendibo, copeleco uliyense lalinga mubili wakame, nakabe nebuyumi pakuba mulinjame. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Shinkwa walafuma kwilu ni wopelowu. Wapusana ne mana asa bashali benu ngobalikulya, nsombi panyuma pakendi balikabafwa. Nomba lalinga shinkwa wopelowu, nakabe nebuyumi butapu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesu walamba ibi mpwalikwiyisha munga'nda yakupaililamo ku kapelenaumu.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi a buyumi butapu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bangi mpobalamunyumfwa kambeco balambeti, “Ciyo ici cayuma, niyani wela kucinyumfwishisha?” <verse number="61" style="v"/>Yesu walenshiba mumoyo mwakendi kwambeti beshikwiya bakendi balatongaukunga. Neco walabepusheti, “Sena mulepilwa? <verse number="62" style="v"/>Nomba nimukense aconi mwakabona Mwana Muntu kaya kwilu nkwalikuba? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Mushimu wa Lesa eukute kupa buyumi, mubili paliya ncokute. Maswi ngondamwambili akute kuleta mushimu wa Lesa ukute kupa buyumi. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Nomba pali nabambi pali amwe balabulunga kushoma.” Pakwinga Yesu walenshiba kendi eshakabule kumushoma, walamwinshibila limo weshakamuyabe kubalwani bakendi. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Lino walambeti, “Weco ndamwambilingeti paliya muntu wela kwisa kuli njame na Bata baliya kumupa ngofu sha kwisa kuli njame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kufumapo beshikwiya bangi ba Yesu balamushiya ne kucileka kwenda nendi. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walepusha beshikwiya likumi ne babili basa, “Nomba amwe nkamulandanga kuya?” <verse number="68" style="v"/>Shimoni Petulo walambeti, “Mwami, nomba ngatuya kuli bani? Njamwe mukute maswi eshikupa buyumi butapu. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Afwe twashoma kayi tucinshi kwambeti njamwe Waswepa walafuma kuli Lesa.” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambeti, “Sena ntame ndalamusala amwe omuli likumi ne babili? Nsombi umo pali amwe ni Satana” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Walikwamba Yuda, mwanendi Shimoni Isikalyoti. Nambi walikuba umo pali basa beshikwiya likumi ne babili, ewalamuyaba kubalwani bakendi.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne bamakwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walikwendana mucishi ca Galileya, nkalikuyanda kuya Yudeya. Pakwinga bamakulene Babayuda balikuyanda kumushina. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Cindi cakusekelela mishasha calikuba pepi, <verse number="3" style="v"/>lino bakwabo Yesu balamwambileti, “Inga nicani kutaya kuYudeya kwambeti beshikwiya bakobe bakabone bikankamanisho mbyolenshinga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuliya muntu ukute kusoleka mbyalenshinga na kayanda kwinshibikwa. Kwelana ne mbyolenshinga leka bantu bonse bakwinshibe.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambi bamakwabo balambeco nkabali kumushoma. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Cindi cakame nkacitana cishika, nsombi amwe mukute cindi cakuya kulikonse nkomulayandanga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bantu basuni byapanshi pano nkabela kumupata, nsombi bakute kupata njame, pakwinga nkute kubalesha ncito shabo shaipa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Amwe kamuyani akusekelela uko. Ame nkandengonga pakwinga cindi cakame nkacina cishika.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalambeco, walashalila mu Galileya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba bamakwabo mpobalaya akusekelela mishasha isa, Yesu neye walabakonkela. Nomba liya kuyanda kubonekela kubantu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bamakulene ba Bayuda balikumuyandaula uko nkobalikusekelela, nkabepushaneti, “Nomba usa muntu ulikupeyo?” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Popelapo palikuba kunung'unusha palyendiye. Bambi balikwambeti, “Usa muntu waina”Nsombi bambi balikwambeti, “Sobwe, usa layungaulunga bantu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba nkapalikuba muntu weshikwamba patuba sha Yesu, pakwinga balikutina Bayuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino kusekelela mpokwalashika pakati, Yesu walaya ku Nga'nda ya Lesa nekutatika kwiyisha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bamakulene ba Bayuda balakankamana nekwambeti, “Nomba muntu uyu ubinshi aconi bintu ibi pabula balamwiyishapo!” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walambeti, “Mbyonkute kwiyisha nte byakame sobwe, nsombi bikute kufuma kuli Bata abo balantuma. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Uliyense layandanga kwinsa kuyanda kwa Lesa, nakenshibeti kwiyisha kwakame kulafumunga kuli Lesa nteko kuli ndemwine <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pakwinga muntu lambangowa byakendi ukute kuliyandawila bulemu. Nsombi nendi ukute bulemu bwa uyo walamutuma, wopeloyo ewancine ncine, kayi mumoyo mwakendi muliya bwipishi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Lino sena Mose liya kumupa Milawo ya Lesa? Nsombi paliya naba umo mulinjamwe ukute kwikonkela. Nomba nicani mulayandanga kunshina?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nsombi likoto lya bantu lyalamukumbuleti, “Sena ulakonyo. Layandanga kukushina niyani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Ndalensowa ceshikukankamanisha cimo, mwense mwalakankamana.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Nte pasa Mose walamupa mulawo wa kupalula bana benu batuloba (mulawo uyo uliya kufuma kuli Mose nsombi walafuma kubamashali benu bakulukulu.) Neco mukute kupalula mwana mutuloba nambi nipa busuba bwa Sabata.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Na mwanoyo mukute kumupalula pa Sabata, nicani nkamukute kutina kupwaya mulawo wa Mose? Nomba nicani mulankalalilinga pacebo cakwambeti ndashilika muntu pabusuba bwa Sabata? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kamucileka kombolosha kwakulanga pamenso, lino tatikani kombolosha mubululami.”</para>
  <para style="s">Sena Yesu eMupulushi Walaiwa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Popelapo bantu nabambi baku Yelusalemu balambeti, “Sena muntu usa ngobalayandanga kushina, nte wopele uyu? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nte uyu lambanga patuba, kwakubula weshikwambapo kantu kalikonse! Ekwambeti aba bantu bacinsheti eMupulushi Walaiwa? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mupulushi Walaiwa akesa, paliya weshakenshibe nkoshakafume. Nomba uyu tukwinshi twense nkwalafumunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu kaciyisha mu Nga'nda ya Lesa walolobesha, “Mukwinshi nkondalafuma. Nsombi ndiya kwisa palwakame sobwe. Uyo walantuma washomeka, nomba amwe nkamumwinshi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nsombi ame ndikwinshi, pakwinga njame ndalafuma kulyendiye, kayi endiye walantuma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Popelapo bantu balayanda kumwikata Yesu, nsombi paliya nambi umo walamwikatamo, pakwinga cindi cakendi calikacitana cishika. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bantu bangi mulikoto ilyo balamushoma, kayi balikwambeti, “Mupulushi Walaiwa akesa, nakensepo bingashilo byapita ibi muntuyu mbyalenshi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Bamalonda balatumwa kuyakumwikata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Neco Bafalisi balanyumfwa kunung'unusha kwa bantu balikwamba sha Yesu. Nomba bamakulene beshimilumbo balatuma bamalonda bamu Nga'nda ya Lesa kwambeti bamwikate. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambileti, “Ndi nenu kwa kacindi kang'ana kantananja kuli walantuma. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Cakubinga nimukanyandaule, nsombi nteshi mukancane. Kayi uko nkondenga amwe nkamwela kushikako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Popelapo bamakulene ba Bayuda balatatika kwipushaneti, “Uyu layandanga kuya kupeyo uko afwe nkotwela kubula kumucana? Sena layandanga kuya kuminshi ya ba Giliki kwekala bantu betu nekuya kubeyisha? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lambangeti, nimukanangaule nsombi nteshi mukancane, kayi eti, uko nkwalenga, amwe nkamwela kushikako. Anu maswi awa alapandululunga cani?”</para>
  <para style="s">Tumilonga twa menshi eshikupa buyumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pa busuba bunene bwakupwisha kusekelela. Yesu walemana nekwamba mwakolobesha, “Napali muntu ukute inyotwa, kesani kulinjame kwisakunwa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Muntu wanshoma, moyo wakendi nukabeti tumilonga twa menshi eshikupa buyumi.Mbuli Mabala a Lesa ncalambangeti, nakabeti tumilonga twa menshi” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu walamba sha Mushimu Uswepa uyo bantu bamushoma ngoshi bakatambule. Pacindico Mushimu Uswepa walinkautana upewa kubantu, pakwinga Yesu walinkatana utambula bulemu bwakendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupansana kwa bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Popelapo likoto lya bantu mpolyalanyumfwa maswi awa, nabambi balatatika kwambeti, “Cancine muntu uyu niMushinshimi.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nabambi balikwambeti, “uyu eMupulushi Walaiwa usa.” Nsombi nabambi balikwambeti, “Sena Mupulushi Walaiwa ngaufuma ku Galileya sobwe! <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mabala a Lesa alambangeti Mupulushi Walaiwa wela kufumina mu cikombo ca Mwami Dafeti, kayi wela kusemenwa mumunshi wa Betelehemu uko nkwalikwikala Dafeti” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lino bantu balatatika kupansana pacebo ca Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nabambi balikuyanda kumwikata, nsombi paliya walamwikata.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutashoma kwa bamakulene ba Bayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bamalonda ba Nga'nda ya Lesa basa balabwelela kuli bamakulene beshimilumbo neBafalilsi. Nabo balepusha bamalonda basa, “nicani muliya kwisa nendi?” <verse number="46" style="v"/>Bamalonda balakumbuleti, “Bintu uyu muntu mbyalamba paliya muntu naumbi walabyambapo sobwe.” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lino Bafalisi balambeti, “Sena nenjamwe lamubepe kendi? <verse number="48" style="v"/>Sena mwalanyumfwapo kwambeti umo wabamakulene nambi Bafalisi pali wamushoma? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nomba bantu aba baluya batainshi Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose, ecebo cakendi bashinganwa.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lino Nikodemo, umo waBafalisi, usa walaya kuli Yesu kumasuba akunyuma, walabepusha banendi, <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Sena milawo yetu yasuminisha kombolosha muntu ngotutana tunyumfwapo maswi akendi kwambeti twinshibe mbyalenshi?” <verse number="52" style="v"/>Nabo balambeti, “Sena nenjobe owakuGalileya? Koya ubelenge Mabala niwinshibeti kuliya mushinshimi wela kufuma kuGalileya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Popelapo bantu bonse balabwelela kucomwabo.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mutukashi walekatwa bupombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walaya ku mulundu wa ma olifi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mumene mene walaya ku Nga'nda yaLesa. Bantu bonse balesa kulyendiye, walekala panshi nekutatika kubeyisha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bafalisi neBeshiwiyisha Milawo balaleta mutukashi ngobalekata bupombo, nekumwimanika pakati pabo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lino balambila Yesu, “Bashikwiyisha, mutukashuyu wacanika kapombolwa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino kwelana ne Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose mutukashi uyu wela kupwaiwa mabwe. Nomba amwe mulambangapongaconi?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Balamwipusha mwipusho uyu pakumwelesha kwambeti bamucaninepo mulandu. Nomba Yesu pacindi copeleco walakotama, nekutatika kulemba panshi ne munwe wakendi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakupitilisha kumwipusha, Yesu walakotamuka nekubambileti, “pakati penu uyo utana kucimwapo, ayambilile kumanta libwe amupwaye mutukashi uyu.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco, kayi walakotama nekupitilisha kulemba panshi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpobalanyumfweco bantu balatatika kufumapo umo neumo,bamakulene ebalatatikila kupalangana. Lino palashalowa mutukashi usa kaliwemana pantangu pa Yesu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walakotamuka nekumwipusha, “Mutukashi obe balayikupeyo bakupanga mulandu? Sena paliya nambi umo lashalapo kukupa mulandu?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mutukashi walambeti, “Mwami, paliya.” Neye Yesu walamwambileti, “Nenjame nkandakupanga mulandu sobwe. Koya nsombi kuyambila lelo kotakabweshapo kwipisha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu emumuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walambila bantu bonse, “Ame njame mumuni ulamunikilinga bantu bonse. Muntu lankonkonga, nteshi akende mumushinshe, nsombi nakekale mu mumuni weshikupa buyumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nabo Bafalisi balamwambileti, “Ulalinshilinga bukamboni omwine. Bukamboni ubo ntebo bwakubinga.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Nambi ndalinshilinga bukamboni, bukamboni bwakame nibwakubinga, pakwinga ndikwinshi nkondalafuma nenkondenga. Nsombi amwe nkamukwinshi nkondalafuma, nambi nenkondenga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Amwe mukute kombolosha pakukonka miyeyo ya bantu. Ame nkankute kombolosha muntu uliyense. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nsombi ndambeti ng'omboloshe, kombolosha kwakame ngakuba kwancine ncine, pakwinga nkandipo ndenka sobwe, pakwinga Bata balantuma balinenjame. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kayi mumilawo yenu mwalembweti bukamboni bwa bantu babili nibwakubinga <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ame nkute kulinshila bukamboni, nabo Bata balantuma bakute kunjinshila bukamboni.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lino nabo balamwipusheti, “Baiso abo balikupeyo?” Yesu walambeti, “Nkamunjishi, kayi ne Bata nkamubenshi. Nimunjinshi nimubenshi Bata.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu walamba maswi awa mpwalikwiyisha mu Nga'nda ya Lesa, mucipinda cakutambulilamo bupe bwa bantu. Paliya walamwikata, pakwinga cindi cakendi calinkacitana cishika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga shakuya kwakendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu kayi walabambileti, “Ame ndenga, nimukanangaule, nomba nkondenga amwe nkamwela kushikako nimukafwilowa mubwipishi.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino Bayuda balambeti, “Sena layandanga kulishina, pakwambeti, ‘nkondenga, nkamwela kushikako?” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Amwe njamwe ba pacishi capanshi pano, ame ndalafuma kwilu. Amwe mobapanshi pano, nsombi ame ntame wapacishi capanshi sobwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Weco ndalamwambilingeti. nimukafwile mubwipishi bwenu. Pakwinga na nkamulashomonga kwambeti njame wopeloyo lalyambanga, nimukafwile mubwipishi bwenu.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino nabo balamwipusheti, “Obe njobe bani?” Yesu walambeti, “Mbuli ncondamwambilanga pakuyamba. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nkute bingi byakwamba nebyakumomboloshelapo. Walantuma niwancine ncine, kayi nkute kwambila bantu bapanshi pano bintu mbyendalanyumfwa kulyendiye.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bantu basa baliya kwinshibeti Yesu walikwamba sha Baishi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambileti, “Mwakantantika Mwana Muntu, popelapo nimukenshibeti njame wopeloyo lalyambanga. Nimukenshibe kwambeti nkankute kwinsa bintu pandenka, nkute kwamba ibyo Bata mbyobalanjiyisha. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nsombi uyo walantuma, uli pamo nenjame. Nendi nkakute kunshiya ndenka, pakwinga cindi conse nkute kwinsa byeshi kumukondwelesha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mpobalanyumfwa Yesu nkamba makani awa, bantu bangi balamushoma.</para>
  <para style="s">Cakubinga nicikakusungulule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu walambila bantu abo balamushoma, “Na mulakonkelenga kwiyisha kwakame cindi conse, cakubinga nimube beshikwiya bakame. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nimwinshibe cakubinga, kayi naco cakubinga nicikamusungululeni.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nabo balambeti, “Afwe njafwe bana ba Abulahamu, kayi nkatuna tubapo basha ba muntu uliyense. Nomba aconi ulambangeti, ‘nimukasungululwe?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga kwambeti muntu uliyense lenshinga bwipishi nimusha kubwipishi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Musha nkakute kwikalisha panga'nda ya mwami wakendi cindi conse, nsombi mwinepabo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lino namwana lamusungululu, okwambeti mulasungululwa cancine ncine. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ndicinshi kwambeti njamwe bana ba Abulahamu, nsombi mulayandanga kunshina, pakwinga nkamulasumininga maswi akame mumyoyo mwenu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ame nkute kwamba ibyo mbyondalabona kuli Bata, nsombi amwe mulenshinga mbyomwalanyumfwa kuli bameshenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nabo balambeti, “Bameshetu ni Abulahamu.” Neye Yesu walabambileti, “nemuli bana ba Abulahamu, ne mulenshinga bintu mbyalikwinsa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nomba lino mulayandanga kunshina, ame ndamwambilinga makani akubinga ngondalanyumfwa kuli Lesa. Abulahamu liya kwinsapo bintu byamushobo uyu sobwe. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Amwe mulenshinga ibyo bameshenu mbyobakute kwinsa.” Nabo balamwambileti, “ntafwe bana bamu bupombo sobwe, tukutowa mushali wetu umo, Lesa.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Lesa nabanga mushali wenu, ne mwalansuna, pakwinga ndalafuma kuli Lesa, nomba lino ndikuno. Ndiya kwisa mungofu shakame, nsombi sha uyo walantuma. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nomba nicani nkamulanyumfunga mbyondambanga? Pakwinga nkamwela kukonsha nekunyumfwa maswi akame. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Amwe mwalafuma kuli mushali wenu Satana. Pakwinga emubepeshi kayi shikushina kufuminowa cindi cakunyuma kayi, mulyendiye muliya cancine ncine sobwe.Ambanga ukute kwambowa bya mumutwi wakendi <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nsombi ame nkute kwamba cakubinga, weco nkamulanshomonga. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nibani pakati penu welakumpa mulandu wabwipishi? Nipacebo cini ndamwambilanga cakubinga, nkamulashomonga? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Muntu waLesa ukute kukutika maswi a Lesa, nomba amwe mulakananga kunyumfwa, pakwinga ntamwe bantu baLesa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga sha Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Popelapo ba Yuda balamwipusheti, “Sena afwe nkatulambanga cakubingeti njobe wakuSamaliya, kayi wekatwa ne mushimu waipa?” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ndiyawa mushimu waipa. Nkute kulemeka Bata, nsombi amwe nkamukute kumpa bulemu. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nsombi nkandayandanga kulemekwa, nsombi nkwali layandangeti mpewe bulemu, kayi eukute kombolosha mubululami. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilinga muntu anyumfwa maswi akame, nteshi akafwe sobwe.” <verse number="52" style="v"/>Lino bantu balamwambileti, “Lino tulenshibi kwambeti ukute mushimu waipa. Abulahamu nebashinshimi bonse balafwa! Nomba obe ulambangeti muntu anyumfwa makani akobe nteshi akafwe sobwe. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Sena obe wapita Abulahamu mushali wetu mukulukulu nebashinshimi bonse balafwa? Nomba ulayeyengeti njobe bani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Na kandilipa bulemu, bulemubo nibwabulyo. Nomba Bata,bakute kumpa bulemu,abo nenjamwe mbomulambangeti eLesa wenu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Amwe muliya kumwinshiba, nsombi ame ndimwinshi, nendalambeti nkandimwinshi nendalaba mubepeshi mbuli ncemubele. Nomba ame ndimwinshi weco nkute kunyumfwa maswi akendi. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mushali wenu mukulukulu Abulahamu walikuba walasekelela kubona kwisa kwakame. Kayi walakondwa.” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Lino ba Yuda balamwipusheti, “Byaka byakobe nkabina bikwana nambi makumi asanu, ngowambaconi eti walamubona Abulahamu?” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga, Abulahamu nkatanasemwa, ndalikubapo.” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Lino mpobalanyumfweco balabwesa mabwe kwambeti bamupwaye. Nsombi Yesu walasolama ne kupita mubantu nekufuma mu Nga'nda ya Lesa.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lashilikinga washipilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalikwenda walabona muntu walasemwa kaliwashipilwa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balamwipusheti, “mwiyi, niyani walalubisha kwambeti muntuyu asemwe kaliwashipilwa? Sena nimwine nambi, nibashali bakendi?” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Nteko kwambeti walasemwa kaliwashipilwa cebo ca bwipishi bwakendi, nambi bwipishi bwabashali bakendi sobwe.Nsombi kwambeti Lesa apewe bulemu kupitila mumuntuyu <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkakucili munshi twela kusebensa ncito njebalantumina Bata. Mashiku alesanga muntu wela kusebensa <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kandicili panshi pano, njame ndapanga mumuni bantu bonse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco, Yesu walasankila mata panshi, walakandila tumankatya nekumunanika mumenso muntu washipilwa <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino walamwambileti, “Koya usambe pakalishiba kaSiloyamu. Lina lyakwambeti Siloyamu lilapandululungeti mutumwa. Neco muntuyo walaya akusamba, walatatika kulanga mpwalikubwelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Popelapo baneshi nnebantu balikumubona nkasenga senga balambeti, “Sena uyu nte usa walikukute cinga cakusenga senga kaliwekala panshi?” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bambi balambeti, “Ee endiye.” Nabambi balikwambeti, “Nteye, wakoshanakowa nendi.” Nsombi mwine walambeti, “Njame.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino bantu basa balamwipusheti, “Nomba nicani capesheti utatike kubona?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nendi walambeti, “Muntu usa ngobakute kukuweti Yesu, walakandila bulongo nekunanika mumenso mwakame nekung'ambileti, ‘Koya, usambe mukalishiba kaSiloamu. Mpondalasamba ndalatatika kubona.’” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neco basa bantu balamwipusheti, “Ingalino ulikupeyo?” Muntu usa walambeti, “Nkandikwishi nkwabele.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bafalisi balepushunga muntu walashilikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Neco balamumanta usa muntu walikuba washipilwa nekuya nendi kuli bamakulene baBafalisi, <verse number="14" style="v"/>pakwinga busuba mbwalakandila bulongo mbwalashilikisha muntu washipilwa bwalikuba bwaSabata <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neco bamakulene ba Bafalisi balamwipusheti, “Obe watatika coni kubona?” Nendi walabambileti, “walananika bulongo mumenso, ndalaya akusamba, weco lino ndabononga.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ba falisi nabambi balambeti, “Muntuyu nkalatumwa neLesa, pakwinga nkalakonkelenga mulawo wa Sabata.” Nsombi nabambi balambeti, “Muntu shikwinsa byaipa ngawinsa byeshikukankamanisha byamushobo uyu?” Neco palaba kupansana umo ne munendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kayi muntusa walikuba washipilwa Bafalisi balamwipusheti, “Nomba obe ulambangaponga aconi pali uyo lakushiliki?” Neye walambeti, “Ni Mushinshimi.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba bamakulene ba Bayuda nkabalashometi muntuyo nkalikubona nomba lino labononga, mpaka balakuwa bamashali bakendi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mpobalesa balabepusheti, “Amwe uyu nimwanenu? sena nicakubinga walasemwa nkatalanga? Nomba kulabeconi kwambeti lino lakonshonga kubona?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bamashali bakendi balambeti, “Ncotwinshi afwe nikwambeti uyu nimwanetu, kayi walasemwa nkatalanga. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino nkatucinshi cilenshiki kwambeti atatike kubona, kayi nkatucinshi mobilenshikili. Kayi nkatumwinshi naniyani lamushiliki. Kamumwipusha mwine nimukulene.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bashali balambeco cebo cakutina bamakulene baBayuda, abo balapangana kwambeti, muntu uliyense eshyakambeti Yesu eMupulushi Walaiwa, nibakamutandanye munga'nda yakupaililamo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Weco bashali bakendi balambeti, “nimukulene, kamumwipushani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Popelapo bamakulene baBayuda balamukuwa katubilli usa muntu walikuba washipilwa, nekumwambileti, “Lumbila kuli Lesa, kayi wambe cakubinga. Afwe tucinshi kwambeti muntu usa nishikwinsa byaipa.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nendi walambeti, “nkandicinshi nanishikwinsa byaipa, ncenjinshi, nikwambeti nkandalikubona, nsombi lino ndabononga.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nabo balamwipusheti, “nomba walakwinsaconi pakukushilika?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nendi walabakumbuleti, “Ndamwambilikendi, nomba muliya kunyumfwa. Nomba nicani mulayandanga kubinyumfwa kayi? Mpani nenjamwe mulayandanga kuba beshikwiya bakendi?” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Popelapo balatatika kumushingana, nekumwambileti, “Njobe shikwiya wakendi. Afwe njafwe beshikwiya baMose. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Twashometi Lesa walambila Mose, nomba uyu nkatukwinshi nkwalafuma.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Muntuyo walakumbuleti, “Ndakankamananga kunyumfweti nkamukwinshi nkwalafuma, nsombi elamboneshe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tucinshi kwambeti Lesa nkakute kunyumfwila bantu beshikwinsa byaipa. Lesa, ukute kunyumfwila bantu bakute kumunyumfwila nekwinsa mbyalayandanga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kufuma kumatatikilo acishi kuliyawa muntu walanyumfwapo kwambeti muntu lashiliki muntu walasemwa kaliwashipilwa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Muntuyu nalabula kufuma kuli Lesa, naliyawa kucikonshya kwinsa ici cintu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kushipilwa kwa kumushimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino nabo balambeti, “Obe walasemwa mubwipishi. Ulayandanga kutwiyisha?” Mpobalambeco balamutandanya mung'anda yakupaililamo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalanyumfweti bamakulene baBayuda balamutandanya munga'nda yakupaililamo usa walikuba washipilwa mpwalamucana walamwipusheti, “Wamushoma Mwana Muntu?” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nendi walambeti, “Mwami, ng'ambileni niyani kwambeti ndimushome!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Ulamubono kendi, endiye lambanga nenjobe.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Neye walamusuntamina nekwambeti, “Mwami, ndashomo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambeti, “Lombolosho ndondaleshila nikwambeti batabono babone, balabononga bashipilwe.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Bafalisi nabambi balikuba pepi, mpobalanyumfweco balamwipusheti, “Sena nenjafwe twashipilwa?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Nemwanga mwashipilwa, nemuliya mulandu. Nsombi pakwinga mulalyambangeti, mulabononga, ekwambeti mucikute mulandu.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wamwembeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walambeti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga, muntu labulunga kwingilila pacishinga cambelele nikabwalala kayi nikapondo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nsombi muntu lengililinga pacishinga endiye mwembeshi wa mbelele. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mulonda ukute kumucalwila. Mbelele shikute kunyumfwa maswi akendi, kayi ukute kushikuwa maina mbelele shakendi, nekushipulisha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ashipulisha ukute kushitangunina, nashoyo shikute kumukonkela, pakwinga shikute kwinshiba maswi akendi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mwensu nkashela kumukonkela sobwe, pakwinga nkashainshi maswi a mwensu. Neco shikute kumufwamba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu walabambila mukoshano uyu, nsombi nabo baliyakunyumfwishisha ncalikubambila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu emwembeshi waina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi kayi Yesu ncalabambilileti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga, ame njame cishinga cambelele. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bonse balesa kantanjisa nibakabwalala kayi nibakapondo, neco mbelele shiliya kubanyumfwila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Njame cishinga, bonse balengilinga kupitila mulinjame nibakapuluke. Kupitila mulinjame nibakengilenga ne kupula nekucana cakulya. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nsombi nendi kabwalala ukute kwishila kwiba, kushina ne kononga. Nomba ame nkandipo ico, ndalesa kupa bantu buyumi, kayi bwakwaninina.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ame njame mwembeshi waina. Mwembeshi waina ukute kutaya buyumi bwakendi pacebo cambelele shakendi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba mwembeshi wakwingisha ncito yakwembela mbelele nte mwembeshi waina pakwinga nte mwine neco abona kaumpe ukute kushishiya nekufwamba, nomba nako kaumpe kakute kwikatapo nashimbi kayi shilashala shikute kupalangana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Usa shikulembwa incito ukute kufwamba, pakwinga ntemwinesho, neco nkakute kusukama. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ame njame mwembeshi waina. Mbelele shakame ndishinshi, kayi nashoyo shinjishi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>mbuli bata ncobanjishi, nenjame ndibenshi, ndalibambila kutaya buyumi bwakame pacebo cambelele shakame. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kayi nkute nashimbi mbelele shabula kuba shamucata ici. Nashoyo nishikanyumfwe maswi akame, ninkashilete pamo,nishikabe mulitanga limo kayi ne mwembeshi umo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Bata bansuni, pakwinga ndalibambila kuyaba buyumi bwakame kwambeti nkabe nabo kayi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuliya muntu wela kundamuna buyumi bwakame, ndabuyabanga mukuyanda kwakame. Nkute ngofu shakutaya buyumi bwakame, kayi ne ngofu shakubumanta. uwu emulawo ngobalampa Bata.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bantu balatatika kupansana pacebo ca maswi awa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bangi pakati pabo balikwambeti, “Ukute mushimu waipa, kayi wakonya. Nicani mulamunyumfwilinga?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba bambi balikwambeti, “Maswi awa ntewo amuntu wekatwa ne mushimu waipa. Sena mushimu waipa ngaumubonesha washipilwa kwambeti abone?”</para>
  <para style="s">Bayuda balakananga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino calikuba cindi camupewo pakusekekelela kupwa kwa kwibaka Ng'anda ya Lesa ku Yelusalemu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walinkenda mumukushi wa Nga'nda ya Lesa, walikukwiweti mukushi waSolomoni. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino bamakulene baYuda balamubunganina nekumwipusheti, “Nomba nukatuyubwilile lilyoni nanjobe Mupulushi Walaiwa? Twambile.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ndalamwambila kendi, nsombi nkamulashomonga. Mulimo ngonkute kwinsa mulina lya Bata, eukute kunjishila bukamboni. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nomba amwe nkamulashomonga, pakwinga nkamulipo mulikoto lyambelele shakame. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mbelele shakame shikute kunyumfwa maswi akame. Ame ndishinshi, kayi shikute kunkonkela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nkute kushipa buyumi butapu, kayi nteshi shikataike. Paliya muntu wela kundamuna. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bata balampa mbelele isho banene kupita bonse, neco paliya muntu wela kubalamuna mumakasa abo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ame neBata tobamo muntu umowa.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lino bamakulene baBayuda balabwesa mabwe kwambeti bamupwaye. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Ndamuboneshe mulimo waina walafumina kuli Bata. Nomba nipa ncito shipeyo nshomulayandanga kumpwaila mabwe?” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bamakulene ba Baciyuda balamukumbuleti, “Nkatulayandanga kukupwaya mabwe pacebo ca mulimo waina sobwe, nsombi pacebo cakwambeti ulanyanshanga Lesa. Obe omuntu, ulalyelanikinga neLesa.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Sena mu Milawo yenu nkamwalembweti, ‘Ame ndambeti mobalesa? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Tucinsheti Mabala a Lesa nkela kupwaiwa. Kayi nakubinga, naLesa walikubakuwa, balapewa maswi wakendi eti balesa.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Ngamwabaconi uyo Lesa ngwalaswepesha nekumutuma pacishi capanshi, amwe mulamwambilingeti lanyanshanga Lesa, sena nipacebo cakwambeti njame Mwana wa Lesa? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nomba na nkandenshinga mulimo ngobalampa Bata, kamutanshoma. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nsombi na emulimo ngondenshinga, kamushomani mulimo nambi nkamulanshomonga kwambeti mukonshe kwinshiba nekunyumfwishisha kwambeti ame nkute kwikala muli Bata, nabo Bata bakute kwikala muli njame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Popelapo bantu basa balayanda kayi kumwikata, nsombi neye walapushumuka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu walabwelela kayi kutala kwa mulonga wa Yolodani uko Yohane nkwalikubatishila bantu pakuyamba, lino walekala kopeloko. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balesa kulyendiye, nkabambeti, “Yohane liya kwinsapo byeshikukankamanisha sobwe, nsombi byonse mbyalikwamba pamuntu uyu byalikuba byakubinga.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kopeloko bantu bangi balashoma Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>muntu walikukwiweti Lazaro, walakolwa, walikwikala mumunshi waBetaniya, kucomwabo Maliya ne Malita. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Uyu Maliya endiye usa walananika mafuta anunkila kumyendo yaMwami nekumupukutisha mishishi yakendi. Lazaro walikuba mukwabo Maliya Lazalo ewalikukolwa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino bamakwabo batukashi balatuma mulumbe kuli Yesu kumwambileti, “Mwami, munenu ngomusuni nimulwashi.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu mpalanyumfwa walambeti, “Kukolwa uko nteshi kumushine Lazalo sobwe, nsombi cilenshiki kwambeti Lesa alemekwe, kayi kwambeti Mwanendi Lesa apewe bulemu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu walikusuna Malita nekanike wakendi, kayi neLazalo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba mpalanyumfwa shamalwashi, Yesu walekala masuba abili pamusena popelapo mpwalikuba. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi walambila beshikwiya bakendi, “katuyani kuYudeya.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balambeti, “Mwiyi, lino apa bamakulene baBayuda nkabayanda kumupwaya mabwe, Inga nicani mulayandanga kubwelelako?” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Sena busuba ntebukute mifunshya yacindi likumi ne ibili? Muntu nalendenga mu mumuni nkela kulisuntula pakwinga ukute kubona mumuni wacishici. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nsombi nalendenga mashiku empwela kulisuntula, pakwinga nkalendenga mu mumuni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco walabambileti, “Lazalo, munetu lono tulo, nsombi ndenga akumupundusha kutulo.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balambeti, “Mwami, nawona tulo, nabe cena.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Balo balikuyeyeti walikwamba shatulowa, nsombi Yesu walikwambeti Lazalo wafwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambila mwakutasoleketi, “Lazalo lafu, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkandabangonga, nsombi ndakondwa cebo canjamwe kwambeti mushome. Katuyani.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Popelapo Tomasi, walikukwiweti mpundu, walambila beshikwiya banendi, “Katuyani nendi tuyetufwile pamo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu eshikupundusha nekupa bantu buyumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika kuBetaniya walacaneti Lazalo wabikwa kendi mumanda masuba ana alapiti. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Munshi waBetaniya walikuba pepi neku Yelusalemu, musuma wakwanowa makilomita atatu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi kwalikuba bantu bangi balesa kuli Malita ne Maliya kwisakubatontosha pacebo ca lufu lwa Lazalo mukwabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Malita mpwalanyumfeti Yesu lesanga, walayakumucinsha. Nomba Maliya walashala munga'nda. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino Malita walambila Yesu, “Mwami, nemwanga kuno mukwetu Lazalo naliya kufwa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nsombi nambi lino ndicinsheti Lesa namupeni ciliconse ncomwela kumumusenga.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Mukwenu napunduke.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Malita walambeti, “Ndicinsheti nakapunduke pa busuba bwakupwililisha bantu bonse bakapundukanga.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “weshikupundusha bantu kubafu nekupa buyumi njame. Muntu washoma ame, nambi ufwa nakabe ne buyumi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kayi abo bayumi banshoma nteshi bakafwe sobwe. Sena ulashomonga?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nendi walambeti, “Cakubinga Mwami, ndashomeshesha njamwe Mupulushi Walaiwa, Mwana wa Lesa, walikuyandika kwisa pacishi capanshi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalilinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Malita mpwalambeco, walamukuwa Maliya kanike wakendi kumbali nekumwambileti, “Lashiki Shikwiyisha, lakukunga.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Maliya mpwalanyumfwa bwite, walanyamuka bwangu bwangu, nekwisa kuli Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pacindici Yesu walinkatana ashika mumunshi, nsombi walikacili pamusena mpobalakumana ne Malita. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nomba bantu balikuba munga'nda kabatontosha Maliya, mpobalaboneti lanyamuku bwangu bwangu kufuma mung'anda, balamukonka. Balikuyeyeti lenga akulilila kumanda. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Maliya mpwalashika palikuba Yesu, nekumubona, walaliwisha panshi kumyendo kwakendi nekwambeti, “Mwami, nemwanga kuno, mukwetu naliya kufwa.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona Maliya kalila kayi nebantu balikubapo nkabalila, walekatwa kumoyo kayi calamubaba. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino walabepusheti, “Mwalamubika kupeyo?” Balambeti, “Mwami, katuyani mukubone.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu walalila. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Popelapo bantu basa balambeti, “bonani, ncanga wamusuna.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nomba nabambi pakati pabo balambeti, “Muntuyu walashilika muntu washipilwa usa, Inga walalilwaconi kushinkilila Lazalo kwambeti nkatafwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu walikacililila mucali, mpwalikuya kumanda. Lino manda alikuba amuliceni, pacishinga pa manda palikuba cilibwe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lino walambeti, “Cifunyeni cilibweco.” Malita, mukwabo Lazalo walafwa, walamwambileti, “Mwami latatiki kendi kununka, pakwinga palapiti masuba ana.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu walamwipusheti, “Sena ndiya kukwambileti washoma nubone bulemu bwaLesa?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lino bantu mpobalafunya cilibwe cisa. Yesu walalanga kwilu nekwambeti, “Ta, ndamulumbunga kwambeti mukute kunkumbula ndasenganga. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ndicinshi kwambeti mukute kunyumfwa cindi conse. Lino ndambangeci pacebo calikoto lyabantu balipano kwambeti, bashometi njamwe mwalantuma.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco walakuwa mwakolobesheti, “Lazaro, pula!” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Popelapo muntu usa walikuba wafwa walapula kenda kaliwapombailwa bikwisa byamalila kumakasa mpaka kumyendo,cikwisa cimbi calikuba cafwekelela kumenso. Yesu walabambileti, “Mupombololeni, kayi mumuleke ende.”</para>
  <para style="s">Balapangananga sha kushina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateyo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bangi bantu balamushindikila Maliya, balabona bintu mbyalensa Yesu balamushoma. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nsombi Bayuda nabambi balaya kuli bamakulene baBafalisi, kuyakubambila byonse Yesu mbyalensa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lino bamakulene beshimilumbo neBaFalisi balakuwa nkuta inene ya Bayuda, nekwipushaneti, “Nitwinseconi lino, pakwinga muntuyu lenshinga byeshikukankamanisha bingi?<figure style="fig" desc="" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:47">Shimilumbo Waciyuda</figure> <verse number="48" style="v"/>Twamulekelela bantu bonse nibamushome, nomba Baloma nibakese bakatonongele Ng'anda ya Lesa, kayi ne mushobo wetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nsombi umo pakati pabo, lina lyakendi Kayafa, mukulene wa beshimilumbo bonse mucaka ico, walabambileti, “Mwatabila aconi amwe! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Sena amwe nkamulabonongeti caina kwambeti muntu umo afwile bantu bonse, kupita kwambeti mushobo wonse wonongeke?” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Cakubinga kwamba kulico nkakwalikuba kwamumano akendi sobwe. Pakwinga walikuba Shimilumbo Mukulene, walikushinshima kwambeti Yesu nakafwile mushobo wa bantu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Cakubinga nteko kwambeti kubafwila bonkowa nsombi, kubunganya pamo bana baLesa balamwaika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kufumina busa busuba bamakulene ba Bayuda balatatika kupangana sha kushina Yesu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Weco Yesu nkalikwenda pantangalala pakati pabantu. Nomba walafumako nekuya kucishi calikuba pepi necinyika, kumunshi walikukwiweti Efulemu, nkwalekala kopeloko pamo nebeshikwiya bakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Kusekelela kwa Pasika kwalaseng'ena pepi. Neco bantu bangi beshikufuma kuminshi balaya ku Yelusalemu kucika cakuliswepesha, Pasika nkayitana iyamba. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Balikumulangaula Yesu, lino mpobalabungana mu Nga'nda ya Lesa balepushaneti “Sena amwe mulayeyengaconi? Sena lesanga ku Pasika kuno?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nomba bamakulene beshimilumbo neBafalisi balambeti uliyense lenshibi kuli Yesu, atwinshibishe kwambeti bamwikate.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lananikwanga mafuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpokwalashala masuba asanu nebumo kwambeti Pasika ishike, Yesu walaya ku Betaniya, uko kwalikuba Lazalo usa ngwalapundusha kubafu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Balamubambila cakulya cakulemeka Yesu, ico Malita ncalabanyamfwilisha kutebeta. Lazalo walikubapo mpobalikulya pamo ne Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino Maliya walamanta libotolo lyamafuta anunkila nado, adula cikamba nekutatika kunanika myendo ya Yesu, kapukutisha nemishishi yakendi. Lino bantu balikuba mung'anda balanyumfwa bwema bwamafutayo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba Yuda Isikalioti, umo wa beshikwiya baYesu, uyo panyuma pakendi walamuyaba kubalwani bakendi, walambeti, <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Nomba nicani mafuta awa uliya kwaulisha mali a muwayawaya akwana 300 kwambeti apewe kubantu bapenga?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Uku nkakwalikuba kwambeti usuni bapenga sobwe, nsombi pacebo cakwambeti walikuba kabwalala. Nendi ewalikusunga mali nekwibamo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “mulekeni abike mafuta awa kushikila busuba bwa kubikwa mumanda kwakame. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakwinga bantu bapenga nimubenga nabo cindi conse, nomba ame nteshi mubenganga pamo nenjame cindi conse.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bantu balapangananga shakushina Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bantu bangi mpobalanyumfweti Yesu uli kuBetaniya, nabo balayako. Baliya kuya pacebo caYesu enka sobwe, nsombi balayakubona Lazaro ngwalapundusha kubafu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Weco bamakulene beshimilumbo balapangana shakwambeti Lazaro neye bamushine, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pakwinga pacebo ca Lazaro bantu bangi bali kubashiya nekushoma Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lengilinga mu Yelusalemu ne Bulemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateyo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Busuba bwalakonkapo bantu bangi balesa akusekelela Pasika, balanyumfweti Yesu lesanga kuYelusalemu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Neco balamanta misampi yamalala nekuya akukumana nendi. Kabolobesheti, “Bulemu kuli Lesa! Walelekwa uyo lesanga mulina lya Mwami! Alelekwe Mwami wa Islaeli!” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu walatanta mwana wa mbongolo ngobalamuletela, mbuli Mabala ncalambangeti, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kotatina, obe munshi wa Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q">“Bona, Mwami wakobe lesanga,</para>
  <para style="q">watanta mwana wa mbongolo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pacindico beshikwiya bakendi baliya kunyumfwishisha. Nsombi Yesu mpwalapunduka nebulemu, empobalanuka kwambeti ibi byalembwa muMabala byalikwamba endiye, nekwambeti balamwinshila bintu ibi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bantu balikuba neYesu mpwalakuwa Lazaro mumanda nekumupundusha kubafu nabo balapitilisha kwamba pabintu mbyobalabona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi bantu ncebalayilakukumana nendi, pakwinga balanyumfwa ceshikukankamanisha ncalensa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Popelapo Bafalisi balatatika kwambilaneti, “Bonani afwe paliya ncetulenshinga, pakwinga bantu bonse balafwambilinga kulyendiye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bagiliki nabambi balalangaulunga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nomba kwalikuba Bagiliki nabambi pakati pabantu balaya kuYelusalemu akupaila pacindi cakusekelela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ba Giliki balayakubona Filipo, waku Betisaida muGalileya. Balamusengeti, “nkambo tulayandanga kubona Yesu.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Filipo walambila Ndileya, bonse babili balaya akwambila Yesu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Cilashiki cindi cakwambeti Mwana Muntu atambule bulemu bwakendi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwamba cakubinga, imbuto ya witi yabula kubyalwa mubulongo nekufwa ikute kaili imo imo. Nomba yafukilwa, ikute kukula nekusema bisepo bingi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Muntu usuni buyumi bwakendi, nakabutaye, nsombi uyo utabusuni buyumi bwakendi mucishi cino nakapewe buyumi butapu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Muntu layandanga kunsebensela, ankonkele, kwambeti musebenshi wakame akabe nenjame kulikonse nkotinkabenga. Muntu asebensela ame, Bata nibakamupe bulemu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga sha lufu lwakendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Lino ndapengenga mumoyo. Nomba ng'ambe cani? Sena ng'ambeti, ‘Bata kamumpulusha pacindici ku mapensho alesanga pantangu? Nomba sobwe, pakwinga encondaleshila. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Bata kamulemekani Lina lyenu.” Popelapo kwalanyumfwika Maswi kwilu akwambeti, “ndalilemeke, kayi nimpitilishe kulilemeka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lino likoto linene lyabantu mpolyalanyumfwa maswi awo, balambeti, “Nimukunkumo wa mfula.” Nomba nabambi balambeti, “Nimungelo wambanga nendi.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Maswi aliyakunyumfwika pacebo ca Njame sobwe, nsombi nakumunyamfwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lino ecindi cakwambeti cishi capanshi comboloshewe. Lino Satana, mwami wa cishi capanshi, Lesa namuwale kunsa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nomba ndakanyamunwa pelu, ninkabunganye bantu bonse kuli njame.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu walamba maswi awa kwambeti abaleshe mushobo walufu ndoshi akafwe nalo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Bantu basa balamwambileti, “Milawo yetu ikute kwambeti Mupulushi Walaiwa nakabengapongowa. Nomba amwe mulambilingeti Mwana Muntu welela kunyamunwa pelu Mwana Muntu wopeloyo niyani?” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambeti, “Mumuni ucili pakati penu kwacindi cing'ana. Kamwendani, mu mumuni nkauciliko, mushinshe nkautamukoma. Pakwinga uliyense lendenga mumushinshe nkakute kwinshiba nkwalenga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kamushomani mumuni kaucili nenjamwe kwambeti mube bantu bamunikilwa.” Yesu mpwalapwisha kwamba makani awa walafumapo nekuya kumusena nkobatenshi.</para>
  <para style="s">Bayuda baliya kushoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nambi Yesu walensa byeshikukankamanisha bingi, nsombi nabo baliya kumushoma. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ici calenshika mbuli ncalamba mushinshimi Yesaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mwami, niyani lashomo kukambauka kwetu?</para>
  <para style="q">Niyani labono ngofu sha Mwami?” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Neco nkamwalashoma pakwinga mbuli Yesaya kayi walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Lesa walabapofola menso,</para>
  <para style="q">nekuyumisha mitwi yabo,</para>
  <para style="q">cakwambeti menso abo nkacikonsho kubona,</para>
  <para style="q">nambi kwishiba nemyoyo yabo.</para>
  <para style="q">Nambi kusandukila kuli njame kwambeti ndibasengule.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesaya mpwalikwamba maswi awa, walikwamba sha Yesu, pacebo cakwambeti walabona bulemu bwakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nomba nikukabeco batangunishi babo bangi balashoma Yesu. Nsombi pacebo ca kutina Bafalisi kwambeti ngababatandanya mu libungano, nkabalikwambila bantu patuba. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Balikusuna kulumbwa kubantu kupita kulumbwa ne Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi a Yesu nakomboloshe bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walamba mwakolobesheti, “Muntu lanshomonga, nkalashomonga ame ndenka sobwe, nsombi lashomonga uyo walantuma. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kayi muntu labononga ame, labononga uyo walantuma. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ame njame mumuni, kayi ndalesa panshi pano, kwambeti uliyense lanshomo akabule kwikala mumushinshe. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Muntu anyumfwa maswi akame nomba ubula kwanyumfwa, nteshinkamomboloshe pakwinga ndiya kwisa kombolosha cishi, nsombi kwisa kupulusha. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Muntu lankananga, kayi labulunga kutambula maswi akame, mpwali weshakamomboloshe. Maswi ngondamba eshakamupeshe mulandu pa busuba bwakupwililisha! <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ici nicakubinga pakwinga nkankute kwambowa bintu mukuyeya kwakame, nsombi Bata balantuma ebalang'ambila byakwamba, ne mwakwambila. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kayi ndicinsheti milawo njalampa ikute kupa buyumi butapu. Weco mbyonkute kwamba, nkute kwamba Bata ncobalang'ambila.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasambishinga myendo ya beshikwiya bakendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kusekelela kwa Pasika mpokwalikuba pepi, Yesu walenshibeti cindi cakwambeti afume pacishi capanshi kuya kuBaishi cilashiki. Nendi walikubasuna bantu bakendi pacishi capanshi, walabasunishisha cakupwililila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pacindi Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi mpobalikulya cakulya camansailo, Satana walikuba labiki kendi mumoyo wa Yudasi, mwana wa Simoni Isikariote, miyeyo yakwambeti amuyabe Yesu kubalwani bakendi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walikwinshiba kwambeti Baishi balamupa ngofu pabintu byonse. Kayi kwambeti walafumina kuli Lesa, kayi lakenga kuBaishi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neco pacindi ncobalikulya walemana nekufulula mwinjila wakendi wakunsa nekumanta cikwisa cakupukutisha nekucisunga mubukome. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mpwalenseco waletila menshi mumbale, nekutatika kusambisha myendo yabeshikwiya bakendi, nkabapukuta necikwisa cisa ncalasunga mubukome.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mpwalashika pali Simoni Petulo, nendi walambeti, “Mwami, sena ngamunsambisha kumyendo?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Ncondenshinga nkocinshi, nsombi nukenshibe kuntangu.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Petulo walambeti, “Nteshi munsambishe kumyendo sobwe.” Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Na mbule kukusambisha, ekwambeti ntobe weshikwiya wakame.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo walambeti, “Mwami, nanico kamutasambishowa myendo nsombi kumakasa kayi nekumutwi.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Muntu lasamba mubili wonse ukute kuswepa cilayandikinga nikusambowa kumyendo konka. Mwense mulaswepe kufunyakowa umo.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu walambeco pakwinga walikwinshiba kendi uyo weshakamuyabe, encalambileti, “Mwense mulaswepe kufunyakowa umo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kubasambisha kumyendo, walafwala cakufwala cakendi capelu nekubwelela mpwalikuba ekala. Lino walabepusheti, “Sena muleshibi ncondenshili cisa? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Amwe mukute kunkuweti, ‘Mwiyi’ Nambi ‘Mwami.’ Ee mwela kwambeco, pakwinga njame. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba ame ndeMwami kayi Shikwiyisha wenu, ndamusambishi kumyendo yenu, ekwambeti nenjamwe mwelela kusambishana kumyendo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino ndamupa cilesho, kwambeti nenjamwe mwelela kwinshila nabambi mbuli ncondamwinshili. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubingeti, kuliya musebenshi wapita mwami wakendi, kayi kuliya mutumwa wapita walamutuma. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lino mpomulenshibi bintu ibi, Lesa nakamuleleke na mukacinsenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Maswi awa nkandambilinga mwense sobwe, pakwinga ndibenshi abo mbondalasala. Ibi bilenshiki mbuli Mabala a Lesa ncalambangeti, ‘Uyo walikulyela mumbale yakame walambukila.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ndamwambililinga limo ibi nkabitana binshika, kwambeti mukashometi, cakubinga njame. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nomba ndambilishingeti uliyense latambulunga mbondatumunga, latambulunga njame. Kayi lantambulunga, latambulumga walantuma.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambilinga limo shakuyabwa kwakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mateyo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalambeco, walatatika kupenshewa mumoyo nekubambileti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga umo pakati penu nanjabe kubalwani bakame.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balatatika kulangana, kutenshibeti lambanga bani. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walikuba wekala pepi shikwiya ngwalikusuna. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino Simoni Petulo walamukuwa nemakasa shikwiya uyo nekumwambileti, “Bepushe nomba balambanga ani?” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Popelapo shikwiya walikuba pepi walamuyamina Yesu, nekumwipusheti, “Mwami, nomba mulambanga ani?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Uyo ngoshimpe shinkwa ngweshinsunse mumbale.” Lino mpwalapwa kusunsa walapa Yuda Isikaliote mwanendi Simoni Isikaliote.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuda mpwalatambulowa shinkwa Satana walamwingila, popelapo Yesu walamwambileti, “Koya winse bintu mbyolayandanga kwinsa mwakufwambana.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Necikabeco, paliya naba umo pakati abo mbwalikulya nabo walenshiba ncalamwambilila mushoboyo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nomba pacebo cakwambeti Yuda ewalikusunga mali, beshikwiya balayeyeti lamutumunga kuya kula byakulya byalikuyandika pabusuba bwa Pasika, nambi byakupa bantu bapenga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yudasi mpwalatambula shinkwa usa,walapula pansa, kayi kwalikuba kulashipi kendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mulawo walino lino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yudasi mpwalapula, Yesu walambeti, “Lino Mwana Muntu napewe bulemu, Kayi mulyendiye Lesa nalemekeshewe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lino na Lesa lalemekwa kupitila muMwanendi, ekwambeti, nendi Lesa nakamulemeke Mwanendi, kayi ecilenshikinga pacino cindi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mobana bame, ndinenu kwakacindi kang'ana, nimukanangaule, nsombi ndamwambilinga ncondalambila bamakulene ba Bayuda, ‘Nkondenga ame, amwe nkamwela kushikako.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino ndamupanga mulawo walino lino, wakwambeti musunanenga, mbuli mondamusunina, nenjamwe kamusunananga. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pakwinga namusunanenga, bantu bonse nibakenshibeti njamwe beshikwiya bakame.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambilinga Petulo eti nakamukane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mateyo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo walamwipusha Yesu, “Mwami, mulenga kupeyo?” Yesu walambeti, “Nkandela kuya pamo nenjobe sobwe, nsombi nukankonkele mumasuba akuntangu.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Petulo walamwipusheti, “Mwami, ingacelakunkanisha kumukonka lino nicani? Ame ndalibambila kuyaba buyumi bwakame pacebo cenu.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambeti, “Sena walibambila kuyaba buyumi bwakobe pacebo cakame! Cakubinga ndakwambilinga kombwe nkatana alila nunkaneti nkonjishi mankanda atatu.”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu enshila yakuya kuli Bata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi, “Myoyo yenu kaitashupika. Kamushomani Lesa, kayi mushome nenjame. <verse number="2" style="v"/>munga'nda muli Bata muli bipinda bingi yakwikalamo necabula kubeco, nendalamwambila. Ndenga akumubambila misena. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino ndakapwisha kumubambila misena, ninkabwele kwisakumumanta, kwambeti mukabenga nkweshinkabenga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Cakubinga nkondenga mukwinshi, nenshila muyinshi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tomasi walambeti, “Mwami, nkatukwinshi nkomulenga, nomba nshila yakwilako ngatuyinshibaconi?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “ame njame nshila, kayi njame cancine ncine nebuyumi. Paliya muntu welakuya kuli Bata, kwakubula kupitila muli njame. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakwinga nemunjishi, nemwabeshiba Bata. Kufumina lelo mulabenshibi kayi mulababono.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Filipo walambeti, “Mwami tulesheni Bata kwambeti tushome.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Filipo, ndekala nenu cindi citali, nomba nkotana unjinshiba? Labono ame elababono Bata. Nomba nicani ulambangeti, ‘Kotulesha Baiso? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Sena nkaulashomonga kwambeti ame nkute kwikala muli Bata, kayi Bata bakute kwikala muli njame? Maswi ngonkute kumwambila nkakute kufuma kuli njame ndenka sobwe, nsombi Bata abakute kwikala muli njame, endibo bakute kwinsa bintu byonsebi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kamunshomani kwambeti ame nkute kwikala muli Bata kayi Bata bakute kwikala muli njame. Nanteco, shomani ncito shakame. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndambilishingeti uyo lanshomonga mulimo ngondenshinga nendi nakawinse, pakwinga ndenga kuli Bata neco nendi nakense byapita pali ibi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Neco ciliconse ncoshimukasenge muLina lyakame, ninkacinse kwambeti Bata bakapewe bulemu kupitila mu Mwanabo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ninkense ciliconse ncoshi mukasenge muLina lyakame.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lesa latumunga Mushimu Uswepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Na munsuni, konkelani milawo yakame. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino ninkasenge Bata kwambeti, bakamupe weshikumunyamfwilisha naumbi uyo eshakekale nenu masuba onse. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mushimu Uswepa nukamuleshe cancine ncine. Cishi nkacela kumutambula sobwe, pakwinga nkacimubono kayi nkacimwinshi. Nsombi amwe mumwinshi, pakwinga ukute kwikala muli njamwe, kayi nakekale muli njamwe kwacindi conse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nteshi ndimushiyeti bana banshiwa. Ninkese kayi kuli njamwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kulashalowa kacindi kang'ana, cishi capanshi nteshi cikambonepo nsombi amwe nimukambone. Pakwinga ndemuyumi, nenjamwe nimukabe bayumi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pabusuba ubo nimukenshibeti Bata, nenjame tuli muntu umo, kayi amwe nenjame tuli muntu umo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Muntu latambulunga milawo yakame nekwikonka, endiye unsuni. Kayi uyo unsuni ame, Bata nibakamusune. Nenjame ninkamusune, kayi nakenshibe ncombele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yuda naumbi, kutamba usa Yuda Iskaliote sobwe, walamwipusheti, “Mwami nomba ngamuliyubululaconi kuli njafwe kwakubula kuliyubulula ku cishi capanshi?” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, uyo unsuni, nakakonke ciyisho cakame. Nabo Bata nibakamusune, ame ne Bata nitukekale mulyendiye. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Muntu utansuni, nteshakakonkele ciyisho cakame. Maswi awa ngomulanyumfunga nteyo akame sobwe, nsombi na Bata balantuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ndamwambilililimo nkandicili nenjamwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nsombi usa weshikunyamfwilisha, Mushimu Uswepa uyo Bata ngoshibakatume mulina lyakame, endiye weshakamwiyishe byonse, kayi nakamwanusheni byonse ibyo mbyondalamwambila kandicili nenjamwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ndamupanga lumuno. Lumuno ndondelela kumupa. Ndamupanga lumuno lwapusana nelumuno ndocela kupa cishi capanshi. Neco myoyo yenu itashupika nambi kutina. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mulanyumfu mpondamwambilangeti, ndenga, nsombi ndakesanga kayi kuli njamwe. Nemunsuni, nemulakondwa kwambeti ndenga kuli Bata, pakwinga Bata bampita. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ndamwambilililimo bintu ibi nkabitana binshika, kwambeti byakenshika, mukashome. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nteshi mpitilishe kwamba nenjamwe pakwinga Satana mwami wa cishi capanshi, lesanga. Nomba uliya ngofu palinjame, <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nomba bantu bonse bela kwinshiba kwambeti ame nsuni Bata, weco ndenshinga ncobalang'ambila. “Lino kamunyamuka twenga.”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ecitondo ca vaini wancine ncine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ame njame citondo ca vaini, nomba Bata ebalimi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nabo bakute kutimbula misampi iliyonse mulinjame itaseme bisepo. Nomba misampi ikutekusema bisepo Bata bakute kwibambilila cena kwambeti ikate bisepo bingi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Amwe mulapenselwa kayi mulaswepe kendi pacebo ca maswi ngondalamwambila. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kamwikalililani mulinjame kayi nenjame ninkekalilile muli njamwe. Kuliyawa musampi wabulakwikata kucinyina welakwikata bisepo. Copeleco nenjamwe nkamwela kwikata bisepo nankamulekalilinga muli njame.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ame njame citondo cancine ncine ca vaini nomba amwe njamwe misampi. Muntu uliyense eshakekalilile mulinjame, nenjame mulyendiye nakekate bisepo bingi. Weco kwakubula njame kuliyawa ncomwela kwinsa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Namuntu nkalekalanga mulinjame, nakawalwe kunseti misampi yatemwa, ikute kuyuma. Misampi yamushoboyo ikute kubunganishiwa nekuwalwa mumulilo nekutentwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Namulekala mulinjame, kayi maswi akame ekala mulinjamwe, ngamunsenga ciliconse ncomwela kuyanda, nimukapewe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bata bakute kulemekeshewa namulekata bisepo bingi, kayi cikute kulesheti njamwe beshikwiya bakame bancine ncine.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mbuli Bata ncobansuni, nenjame ndimusuni amwe. Mwikalenga mu lusuno lwakame. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Namukonkelenga milawo yakame, nimwikalenga mulusuno lwakame, mbuli ame nconkute kukonkela milawo ya Bata nekwikalilila mulusuno lwabo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ndamwambili ibi kwambeti kukondwa kwakame kube muli njamwe kayi kwambeti kukondwa kwenu kube kwakwana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mulawo wakame niwakwambeti musunanenga mbuli ncondimusuni. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuliya muntu ukute lusuno lwapita ulu lwakutaya buyumi bwakendi pacebo cabanendi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Namulakonkelenga kwiyisha kwakame ekwambeti njamwe mobaname. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nteshi ndimukuwengeti basebenshi sobwe pakwinga musebenshi nkakute kwinshiba bilenshinga mwami wakendi. Nsombi ndamukungeti baname, pacebo cakwambeti byonse mbyondalanyumfwa kuli Bata ndalamwambila. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ntamwe mwalansala sobwe, nsombi njame ndalamusala. Kayi ndalamupatula kwambeti mukekate bisepo bitalobo. Neco ciliconse ncoshimukasenge kuli Bata mulina lyakame nibakamupe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco mulawo wakame niwakwambeti musunanenga.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupatwa ne cishi capanshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Na cishi capanshi cikamupate, mukanuke kwambeti calatatikila kupata njame. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nemwekalangeti bantu bamucishi nebalamusuna, nomba pacebo cakwambeti ntamwe bamucishi capanshi sobwe. Nomba bamupela pakwinga ame ndalamusala pakati pabo, weco ntamwe banabo sobwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kamwanukanga maswi asa ngondalamwambileti, ‘Musebenshi nkapiti mwami wakendi.’ Na balampensha, nenjamwe nibakamupenshe. Na balanyumfwa maswi akame, nibakanyumfwe maswi enu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nsombi nibakamwinshile bintu mbyobalenshila kulinjame, pakwinga nkabamwinshi walantuma. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nendalabula kwisa kubeyisha, nebalabula kuba nemulandu. Nomba lino paliyawa mpobela kukanina mulandu wabo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Muntu lapatananga nenjame, lapatananga neBata. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nendalabula kwinsa bintu pakati pabo bitana binshiwapo nemuntu uliyense, cakubinga nebalakabulu kuba nemulandu. Nomba pakwinga balabibona, nsombi bapata ame neBata. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba byalenshika mushoboyo mbuli ncecalembwa mulibuku lyabo lya milawo kwambeti, ‘Balapatana nenjame kwakubula mulandu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Shikumunyamfwa lakesanga, uyo ni Mushimu weshukayubulule cancine ncine cilambanga shaBata, Ninkamutumine, nendi uyo akesa nakambele bukamboni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nenjamwe nimukambele bukamboni, pakwinga mulekala nenjame kufuma kumatatikilo.”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Ndamwambili makani awa kwambeti mutakatyompwa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino nibakamutandanye mu mandakupaililamo.Kayi cindi nicikashike cakwambeti bantu beshibakamushinenga nibakayeyengeti balasebenselenga Lesa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nibakense bintu bilico pacebo cakwambeti nkababenshi Bata kayi nenjame nkabanjinshi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nsombi ndamwambililinga limo bintu ibi kwambeti cindi cakashika mukanuketi ndalamwambilapo kendi. Ndiya kumwambila bintu ibi pakuyamba pakwinga ndalikuba nenu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Incito sha Mushimu Uswepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba lino ndenga kuli Bata balantuma, nsombi paliya nambi umo lanjipushunga kwambeti, “Ulenga kupeyo.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Nomba mumyoyo yenu mulesulu miyeyo yakungumana pacebo ca bintu mbyondamwambili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nsombi ndamwambilinga cakubinga, caina kuli njamwe kwambeti ame njenga. Pakwinga nankandenga, munyamfwilishi usa nteshi akese kuli njamwe. Nsombi ndaya ninkamutume kulinjamwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lino akesa shikumunyamfwa nakababoneshe bantu ba panshi pano pabwipishi bwabo nepabululami, kayi nekombolosha kwa Mwami Lesa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bacimwa pacebo cakwipa kwabo pakwinga nkabashomo mulinjame. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bacimwa pamakani abululami pakwinga ndenga kuli Bata kayi nteshi mukambonepo sobwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bacimwa pashakombolosha, pakwinga Lesa lamombolosho kendi mwami lendeleshenga cishi cino.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Nkute Maswi angi akumwambila nsombi nkamwela kwanyumfwishisha sobwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nsombi wakashika Mushimu nukamwiyishe byancine ncine. Pakwinga Nteshi ukambenga bintu byakuliyandila sobwe, nsombi bintu ibyo Bata mbyoshibakamwambilenga, endibyo mbyoshi ukambenga. Kayi nukamwiyishe bintu byakuntangu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nukampe bulemu pakwinga nukamante bintu kufuma kulinjame nekwisa kumwambila. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bintu byonse byaBata nibyakame. Weco ndamwambilingeti nukamante bilafumunga kuli njame nekwisa kumwambila.</para>
  <para style="s">Miyeyo ne kusangalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Kwacindi cing'ana nteshi mukambone, nsombi pakapita kacindi cing'anowa nimukambone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi nabambi balatatika kwipushaneti, “Nomba nicani ncalatwambilinga? Lambangeti, ‘Kwacindi cing'anowa nteshi mukambone.’ Kayi lambangeti, ‘pakwinga ndenga kuli Bata.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba inga cilapandululunga cani, ‘Kwacindi cing'ana’ Nkatulanyumfwishishinga mbyalayandanga kutwambila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu walenshibeti balayandanga kumwipusha, neco walabambileti, sena mulepushanyanga pamakani ngondamwambileti, kwakacindi kang'ana nteshi mukambonepo, nsombi pakapita kacindi kang'ana kayi nimukambone? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubinga kwambeti nimukalile kayi nimukongumane, nsombi cishi nicikasekelele. Amwe nimukongumane, nsombi kungumana kwenu panyuma pakendi nikukabe kusekelela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino pacindi cakupulukamo mutukashi ukute kushupika pacebo cakwambeti cindi cilashiki. Nomba mwana asemwa nkakute nekuyeyako shakushupika, pakwinga kukute kuba kusekelela kwambeti mwana lasemwa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nenjamwe mulashupikinga lino, nsombi ninkamubone kayi. Popelapo myoyo yenu nikasekelele, kayi paliya muntu weshakamulamune kukondwa kwenu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Pabusuba ubo nteti mukayande kunjipusha.necikabeco ndamwambilinga cakubinga kwambeti Bata nibakamupe ciliconse nceshi mukasenge mulina lyakame. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kushikila lelo nkamuna musengapo cintu mulina lyakame. Nomba lino mwela kusenga mulina lyakame, neco, nimukapewe, kwambeti kukondwa kwenu kube kwakwana.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakomonga cishi capanshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ndamwambili bintu ibi mumapinda. Cindi nicikashike mposhinkambe pantangalala shaBata, ntetinkambepo mumapinda sobwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Busuba ubo nimukasenge kupitila mulina lyakame, ntetikukayandiketi ndimusengele kuli Bata sobwe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bata bamusuni pakwinga munsuni, kayi mwanshometi ndalafuma kuliBata. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ndalafuma kuli Bata kwisa panshi pano. Lino kayi ndafumunga panshi pano kuya kuliBata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balambeti, “Lino mulambanga mwakunyumfwika, kutamba mumapinda sobwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lino tulenshibi kwambeti mubinshi byonse, neco nkatwela kumwipusha. Weco lino tulashomo kwambeti mwalafuma kuli Lesa.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Sena lino empomulashomo? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Cindi nicishike, kayi cilashiki kendi, nceshimumwaike uliyense kuya kwabo, nimunshiye ndenka. Nsombi nkandipo ndenka sobwe pakwinga Bata bali nenjame. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ndamwambili bintu ibi kwambeti mube neLumuno pakushoma njame. Cishi nicikamupenshe nsombi kamuyumani pakwinga ame ndacikomo cishi capanshi.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapaililinga beshikwiya bakendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalamba bintu ibi, walalanga kwilu nekwambeti, “Cindi cilashiki Ta. Kamumupani bulemu mwanenu, kwambeti nendi Mwanenu amupe bulemu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pakwinga mwalamupa ngofu shakwendelesha bantu bonse kwambeti ape buyumi butapu kuli bonse mbomwalamupa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Buyumi butapu nikwinshiba njamwe kayi neYesu Klistu ngomwalatuma. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndamuletele bulemu pacishi capanshi pakupwisha mulimo ngomwalantuma. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neco Ta kamumpani bulemu pacino cindi ncendesanga kulinjamwe. Bulemu busa mbondalikukute kacitana cilengwa cishi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Balamwishibi cena abo mbomwalampa pano pacishicapanshi, balikuba benu, nsombi mwalampa. Kayi balakonka maswi enu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino bacinshi kwambeti byonse mbyomwalampa byalafuma kulinjamwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakwinga ndalabeisha maswi ngomwalangambila kayi balatambula. Neco bacinshi kwambeti ndalafuma kuli njamwe, kayi bashoma kwambeti njamwe mwalantuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Ndabapaililinga. Nkandapaililinga cishi capanshi sobwe, nsombi ndapaililinga abo mbomwalampa pakwinga nibenu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Byonse mbyonkute nibyenu, kayi byenu byonse nibyakame, neco nkute kupewa bulemu mulyendibo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino ndesanga kulinjamwe. Nteshi mbenganga mucishi capanshi sobwe, ndesanga kulinjamwe, nsombi nabo mobacili. Ta omwaswepa kamubasunga mulina lyenu ndyomwalampa, kwambeti babeti umo mbuli njafwe ncetuli umo <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mpondalikuba nabo, ndalikubasunga nengofu nshomwalampa. Ndalabacingilila cena kayi kuliya nambi umo walataika, kufunyakowa usa walikuba welela kutaika, kwambeti byonse byalalembwa binshike.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Lino ndesanga kuli njamwe. Ndambanga bintu ibi nkandicili panshi pano kwambeti, kukondwa kwakame kwisule mumyoyo yabo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ndabeyishi maswi enu. nsombi cishi cilabapata, pakwinga nabo baliya cibusa necishi capanshi, mbuli ame ncondababula cibusa ne cishi capanshi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkandasengenga kwambeti mubafunye mucishi capanshi sobwe, nsombi kwambeti mubacingilile kumulwani. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nabo ntebo bapacishi capanshi, mbuli ame ncendabula kuba wapa cishi capanshi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mubaswepeshe necancine ncine kwambeti babe benu. Maswi enu ecanci ncine. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mbuli ncemwalantuma ame pacishi capanshi pano, nenjame ndabatumu pacishi capanshi pano. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pacebo cabo ndalibenge kuli njamwe, kwambeti nabo balibenge kuli njamwe mucancine ncine.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nkandapaililinga aba bonka sobwe, nsombi bonse beshibakanshome pacebo ca mulumbe wabo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ndabapaililinga kwambeti bonse bakabebamo. Mbuli amwe Ta ncomuli mulinjame, kayi nenjame ndimulinjamwe nabo bekale muli njafwe. Neco bantu bonse bakashome kwambeti mwalantuma. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ndabapa bulemu mbomwalampa, kwambeti babe bamo, babe mbuli afwe ncetuli bamo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ame njikale mulyendibo, nenjamwe muli njame kwambeti babe bamo cancine ncine. Neco bantu bonse nibakenshibe kwambeti njamwe mwalantuma, kayi mubasuni mbuli ncomunsuni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ndandangeti, abo mbomwalampa babe pamo nenjame uko nkoshi nkabe. Ndandangeti babone bulemu bwakame mbomwalampa, pakwinga mwalansuna kendi nkacitana cilengwa cishi capanshi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Omwalulama Ta, cishi capanshi ciliya kumwinshiba sobwe, nsombi ame ndimwinshi, kayi aba bacinsheti njamwe mwalantuma. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ndalabenshibisha Lina lyenu, kayi ninkapitilishe kubeyisha kwambeti lusuno ndomukute palinjame lube mulyendibo, kwambeti nenjame mbe mulyendibo.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kwikatwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateyo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kwamba walaya pamo nebeshikwiya bakendi kutala kwa cisapa ca Kedroni, nkobalakengila mulibala lya bitondo bya maolifi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Uko Yesu nebeshikwiya bakendi nkobalikukumanina cindi conse. Neco Yuda walamuyaba walikwishiba musena wopelowo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yuda walanyamuka pamo nebashilikali baku Loma nebamalonda baku Nga'nda ya Lesa abo balatumwa nebamakulene beshimilumbo neBafalisi. Nabo balaya kulibala uko kabalibamanta malampi ne nsakamwenge kayi ne byensho byankondo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walikwinshiba byeshibimwinshikile. Weco nendi walemana patuba, nekubepusheti, “Nomba mulayandanga bani?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Balamukumbuleti, “tulayandanga Yesu waku Nasaleti.” Yesu walambeti, “Njame.” Yuda walamuyaba kubalwani bakendi, neye walikubapo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabakumbuleti, “Njame,” Balabwelela kunyuma nekuwa panshi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walabepusha, “Nomba mulayandanga bani?” Nabo balambeti, “tulandanga Yesu wa ku nazaleti.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ndamwambili eti njame, nomba na mulayandanga njame, aba balekeni bayenga.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Walambeco kwambeti bikwanilishiwe mbyalambeti, “Ndiya kutayapo naba umo pali abo mbomwalampa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shimoni Petulo walikukute cingwebe. Walasokolola nekukwempula litwi lyakululyo lya Makasi musebenshi wa shimilumbo mukulene. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambila Petulo, “Bwesha cingwebe cakobe mumukopa. Sena ulayeyengeti mbule kunwa nkomeshi ya mapensho njobalampa Bata?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuli Anasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mateyo 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maliko 14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luka 22:54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mushilikali mukulene nebashilikali bakendi, kayi nebamalondabamuNg'anda ya Lesa, balamwikata Yesu nekumusunga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pakutanguna balaya nendi kuli Anasi, mupongoshi wa Kayafa, walikuba mukulene wa beshimilumbo bonse mucaka copeleco. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kayafa eusa walambila bamakulene baBayuda kumasuba akunyuma kwambeti caina namuntu umo ufwa kupita kwambeti bantu bonse bafwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo lakananga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mateyo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shimoni Petulo neshikwiya naumbi balamukonkela Yesu. Shikwiya naumbi uyo walikuba wenshibana neshimilumbo mukulene. Lino walengila pamo ne Yesu munga'nda ya shimilumbo mukulene. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nsombi Petulo walemana kunsa pepi necishinga, usa shikwiya walikuba wenshibikwa walapula nekuya kwamba nemutukashi pacishinga kwambeti ambile Petulo engile, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nomba mutukashi musebenshi walepusha Petulo, “Sena obe ntobe umo wa beshikwiya bamuntuyu?” Petulo walambeti, “Ame? Sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwalikuba kwatontola, neco basebenshi ne bamalonda balakunka mulilo ngobalikuyota bwimene,neye Petulo walayakwimanapo kayota mulilo.</para>
  <para style="s">Shimilumbo mukulene lepushunga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateyo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco shimilumbo mukulene walepusha Yesu sha beshikwiya bakendi, kayi nebintu mbyalikwiyisha. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ame ndalikwamba mwakutasoleka ku muntu uliyense. Ndalikwiyisha mumanda akupaililamo kayi ne mu Nga'nda ya Lesa, bantu bonse mobakute kubungana. Ndiya kwambapo bintu mwakusoleka sobwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba lino mulanjipushilinga cani? Kamwipushani abo balanyumfwa bintu mbyondalikwamba bacishi ncendalikwiyisha.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco, umo wa bamalonda walikuba wemana popelapo walamuma Yesu nekwambeti, “Ngokumbula aconi mushoboyo shimilumbo mukulene?” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “na ndamba bintu byaipa kobishumbula. Nsombi na ndamba byakubinga nomba ulangumininga cani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino Anasi walamutuma Yesu kaliwasungwa kuli Kayafa shimilumbo mukulene.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo Lakananga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mateyo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo mpwalikuba wemana nkaciyota mulilo, nabambi balamwipusheti, “Sena obe ntobe umo wabeshikwiya ba muntusa?” Petulo walakaneti, “Sobwe ntame.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Musebenshi naumbi wa mukulene wabeshimilumbo bonse, mwanse muntusa Petulo ngwalakwempula litwi, walamwipusheti, “Sena ndiya kukubonapo mulibala musa nkoli nendi?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Petulo walakana kayi, pacindi copeleco kombwe walalila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bamutwalanga kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateyo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mumene mene bamakulene baBayuda balamumanta Yesu kufuma kuli Kayafa nekuya nendi kunga'nda ya mwendeleshi wa Loma. Bantu bangi balashala pansa, kutina kwambeti ningababa babulakuswepa, kayi nkabela kusuminishiwa kulyako Pasika. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Neco Pilato walapulapansa nekubepusheti, “Mulamucana nemulandu cini muntuyu?” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nabo balambeti, “Nalabula kwinsa byaipa muntuyo netuliya kumuleta kuli njamwe sobwe.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Neco Pilato walabambileti, “Mumanteni mwenga mumomboloshe kwelana ne milawo yenu.” Nsombi Bayuda basa balambeti, “Afwe nkatwasuminishiwa kushina muntu sobwe.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ibi byalenshika kwambeti maswi Yesu ngalamba sha lufu lwakendi akwanilishiwe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pilato walengila munga'nda yakendi kayi, nekukuwa Yesu. Walamwipusheti, “Sena obe, njobe Mwami wa Bayuda?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Sena kwamba kulico nikwenu mobene, nambi pali bantu balamwambilapo sha njame?” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pilato walambeti, “Sena ulayeyengeti njame Muyuda? Nibantu bakobe kayi ne beshimilumbo bamakulene endibo balakulete kulinjame, nomba walensa cani?” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Bwami bwakame ntebo bwapacishi capanshi sobwe. Bwami bwakame nebwanga bwapacishi capanshi pano batuloba bakame nebalandwaninini nkondo kwambeti babule kuntwala kuli bamakulene baBayuda. Nsombi bwami bwakame ntebo bwa pacishi capanshi sobwe.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pilato walambeti, “Lino ekwambeti njobe Mwami ntendimo?” Yesu walambeti, “Mulalyambili mobene kwambeti njame Mwami. Ame ndalesa pacishi capanshi pano kayi ndalasemwa nekwisa mucishi kusakwamba cancine ncine. Uliyense usuni cancine ncine ukute kunyumfwa maswi akame.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pilato walamwipusha Yesu, “Anu cancine ncine nicani?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapingulwanga kwambeti ashinwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mateyo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:13-25">Luka 2:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato mpwalamba maswi awa, walapula kunsa kwalikuba Bayuda, nekubambileti, “Ame ndiya kumucanapo ne mulandu uli wonse muntuyu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nsombi kukonka cinga cenu, pacindi ca kusekelela Pasika nkute kumusungulwila muntu umo. Sena mulayandanga kwambeti ndimusungwilile Mwami waBayuda uyu?” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Popelapo nabo balolobesha nekwambeti, “Uyo sobwe nsombi Balaba.” Balaba walikuba cigabenga.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Popelapo Pilato walamumanta Yesu ne kumukwipisha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino bashilikali balabamba mushini wa myunga nekumufwalika kumutwi. Kayi balamufwalika mwinjila wamushobo wabulemu ufubeluka, <verse number="3" style="v"/>balikabesa kulyendiye nkabambeti, “Mitende, mobami ba Bayuda!” Pacindici balatatika kumuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilato walapula pansa kayi nekubambila Bayuda, “Kamubonani ndamulete kuli njamwe, neco mwinshibe kwambeti ndiya kumucanapo ne mulandu uli wonse.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu walapula nkali afwala mushini wa myunga kumutwi ne cakufwala cifubeluka cisa, Pilato walambeti, “Uyu muntusa.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bamakulene beshimilumbo nebamalonda ba mu Nga'nda ya Lesa basa mpobalabona Yesu, balolobesheti, “Mupopeni! Mupopeni!” Pilato walambeti, “Mumanteni mwenka mwenga mumupope pakwinga ame ndiya kumucanapo nemulandu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bantu balambeti, “Afwe tukute mulawo, nomba twakonka mulawo wetu uyu welela kufwa, pakwinga walikwambeti, ‘Njame Mwana wa Lesa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lino Pilato mpalanyumfwa maswi awa, walanyumfwa buyowa kwine. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba walengila kayi munga'nda nekwipusha Yesu, “Nomba obe kwenu nikupeyo?” Nsombi Yesu nkalakumbula sobwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kayi Pilato walamwipusheti, “Nicani nkolankumbulunga? Sena nkocinsheti nkute ngofu sha kukusungulula nekukupopa?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Lesa, abula kumupa ngofu nemuliya kwinsapo ciliconse palinjame. Weco uyo wanjaba kuli njamwe ukute bwipishi bunene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mpwalanyumfwa maswi awa, Pilato walayandishisha kwambeti amusungulule Yesu. Nsombi Bayuda balolobesha, mwamusungulula muntuyu ekwambeti nkamwekatana ne mwami wa kuLoma. Uliyense lalyambanga kuba mwami, ekwambeti nimulwani wamwami wa ku Loma. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilato mpwalanyumfweco, walamupulisha Yesu, nekwikala pacipuna cakomboloshelapo milandu, pabusena bwalikukwiweti, “Lubansa lwa mabwe.” Mu cihebeli ukute kukwiweti, Gabata. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba bwalikuba busuba bwakulibambila sha Pasika, kayi cindi calikuba muma 12 koloko munshi. Pilato walambila Bayuda, “Uyu Mwami wenu.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba nabo balolobesha nekwambeti, “Mushineni! Mushineni! Kapopwani!” Pilato walabepusheti, “Sena mpope Mwami wenu?” Bamakulene beshimilumbo balakumbuleti, “Tuliyawa Mwami naumbi sobwe, nsombi Mwami wa ku Loma enka.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Popelapo Pilato walamutwala Yesu kulyendibo kwambeti bamupope.kufumapo Yesu walaba mumakasa abo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapopwanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateyo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bashilikali balamumantisha Yesu lusanda lwakendi, balapula nendi mulubansa nekuya kumusena walikukwiweti. “Cifupa ca mutwi” Mu Cihebeli bakute kwambeti “Gologota.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kopeloko balamupopa palusanda. Kayi balapopa bantu bambi babili, umbi kulikasa lyalulyo naumbi kulikasa lya kucipiko, Yesu nendi walikuba pakati. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilato walalemba cishibisho pelu palusanda. Walalembeti, “Yesu wa kuNasaleti, Mwami wa Bayuda.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mpwalapopela Yesu palikuba pepi neku Yelusalemu. Neco Bayuda bangi balikababelengapo. Cishibisho ici calikuba calembwa mumishobo itatu, Cihebeli ne Cilatini kayi ne Cigiliki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bamakulene ba beshimilumbo ba Bayuda balambila Pilato, “Kamutalembeti, Mwami wa Bayuda sobwe. Nsombi mwine ewalikulyambeti eMwami wa Bayuda.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba Pilato walambeti, “Mbyondalembe, nibibe copeleco mbuli ncondalembe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bashilikali basa mpwobalapopa Yesu, balamanta bayakufwala byakendi nekutwamunamo tumpansha tuna, mushilikali uliyense walamanta kampansha kakendi. Balamanta kayi nemwinjila wakendi uyo walikuba watungwa necikwisa cimo kayi nkawalikuba ne lupeto. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino bashilikali abo balambilaneti, “Katutautwamuna sobwe, nsombi twinse nsolo kwambeti twinshibe na nibani eshi aumante.” Byalenshika mushoboyo kwambeti bikwanishiwe balambwa mumabala,</para>
  <para style="q">“Balayabana byakufwala byakame,</para>
  <para style="q">kayi mwinjila wakame balawinshila nsolo.”</para>
  <para style="m">Weco ncobalensa bashilikali basa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba pepi ne lusanda palemana banyina, ne mukwabo banyina, kayi palikuba Maliya mukashendi klopa ne Mariya wa ku magadalena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpalabona banyina ne shikwiya usa ngwalikusuna nkabalibemana pepi, walambila banyina eti, “Ma mwanenu uno.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Walambila kayi shikwiya usa eti, “Banyoko aba.” Lino kufumina popelapo shikwiya usa walabamanta batukashi abo ne kutatika kubasunga cena kwakendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa Kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-46">Mateyo 27:45-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu walenshiba kwambeti lino byonse bilakwanilishiwa. Lino kwambeti bikwanilishiwe byonse byalambwa mumabala, nendi walambeti “Nkute inyotwa.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Popelapo palikuba nsupa yesula waini wasasa. Bashilikali basa balasabika cisambo mu waini wasasa usa, nekucisomeka kukatondo ka hisopi nekukashikisha pamulomo pakendi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu mpalasupita waini wasasa walambeti, “Byonse bilakwanilishiwa.” Lino walakotama mutwi nekufwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Balamuyasanga Yesu mumbafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bwalikuba busuba bwakulibambila sha Pasika. Bamakulene ba Bayuda nkabali kwandeti bitumbi ibyo bibe pa lusanda pa busuba bwa Sabata, pakwinga busuba bwa Sabata ubo bwalikuba bunene. Weco balamusenga Pilato kwambeti batyokole myendo ya bantu basa balikuba bapopwa nekubafunya. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lino bashilikali balesa, nekutyokola umo pa babili basa balapopwa pamo ne Yesu. Balensa copeleco ne kumunendi usa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nsombi mpobalashika pali Yesu, pakubona kwambeti lafu kendi, neco baliya kutyokola myendo yakendi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nsombi umo wa bashilikali basa walamuyasa mumbafu ne lifumo, nomba mwalafuma milopa ne menshi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Uyo walabona bintu ibi endiye labinshilinga bukamboni, kwambeti ne njamwe mushome. Bukamboni bwakendi nibwancine ncine, kayi mwine ucinshi kwambeti mbyalambanga nibyakubinga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ibi byalenshika kwambeti byalambwa mumabala bikwanilishiwe, mabala akwambeti, “Nteshi bakatyokole lifupa lyakendi nambi limo.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kayi kuli mabala nambi alambangeti, “Bantu nibakamwebele uyo ngobalayasa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labikwanga mumanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateyo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yosefe wa ku Arimatea walasenga Pilato kwambeti amusuminishe kufunya citumbi ca Yesu. Yosefe walikuba weshikwiya wa Yesu, nsombi mwakusolama, pakwinga balikutina bamakulene ba Bayuda. Lino Pilato walamusuminisha, nendi walafunya citumbi ico. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kwalesa kayi nikodemasi, usa walaya kuli Yesu mashiku pakutatika pasa. Nendi walaleta mafuta anunkila a mule asankanishiwa ne aloe, alikuba alema makilogilamu akwana 32. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Bantu babili aba balamanta mubili wa Yesu nekupomba mucikwisa caswepa ne mafuta anunkila cena, balakonka mwambo wa Bayuda. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Uko Yesu nkwalapopwa kwalikuba libala. Nomba mulibala umo mwalikuba cumbwe calino lino, citana cibikwamo muntu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lino bwalikuba busuba bwa kulibambila kwa Bayuda kusekelela Pasika, Nomba manda ayo alikuba pepi, balabika Yesu mopelomo.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Manda abula citumbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateyo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pabusuba bwa Sondo mumene mene nkapacili pashipa shipa, Mariya wa ku Magadalene walaya ku manda a Yesu. Mpwalashika walabona kwambeti cilibwe cisa cafunywapo kendi pacishinga ca manda. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Neco walafwamba kuya akushika kuli Simoni Petulo ne shikwiya umo usa ngwalikusuna Yesu maningi. Walabambila kwambeti, “Balamufunyumo Mwami mumanda kayi nkatucinshi nkobalamubiki.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Popelapo Petulo ne shikwiya naumbi balapula nekuya ku manda. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bonse babili balafwamba, nomba usa shikwiya naumbi walafwamba kupita Petulo, neco ewalatanguna kushika kumanda. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Walakotama nekubonowa bikwisa nkabili byafungana, nomba nendi liyawa kwingilamo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shimoni Petulo mpwalashika walayakwingila mumanda. Nomba walabonowa bikwisa byabungana nkabili popelapo, <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kayi kakwisa kasa kalikuba kumutwi kwakendi. Kakwisa aka nkakalikuba pamo ne bikwisa nabimbi bisa, nsombi kalikuba pakonka nkakali kapombwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Popelapo shikwiya naumbi usa walatatikila kushika ku manda, nendi walengilamo. Nomba mpwalabona bintu ibi, walashoma. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kushikila cindi copeleco nabo basa balinkabatana banyumfwishisha maswi akwambeti Yesu welela kupunduka kubafu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi beshikwiya basa balabwela kucomwabo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labonekelenga kuli Maliya wa ku Magadalene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateyo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba Maliya walemana pansa pamanda nkalila, nkacilila mushoboyo, walakotama nekusumbila mumanda, <verse number="12" style="v"/>walabona bangelo babili nkabali bafwala mingila ituba. Bangelo abo balikuba bekala panshi,palikuba pona citumbi ca Yesu pasa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nabo balamwipusheti, “Obe mutukashi, ulalilinga cani?” Nendi walakumbuleti, “Pacebo cakwambeti balamufunyumo Mwami wakame kayi nkandicinshi nkobalamubiki.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpwalamba bintu ibi walacebuka nekubona muntu nkali wemana popelapo, nsombi liyawa kumwinshiba kwambeti ni Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walamwipusheti, “Mutukashi obe ulalilinga cani?” Mariya nendi walikuyeya kwambeti nimusebenshi wamulibala, neco walamwambila kwambeti, “Nkambo, na njamwe mulamufunyumo, kamungambilani nkomulamubiki kwambeti njenga akumumanta.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Maliya!” Nendi walacebuka nekwambeti, “Laboni!” Uku ekwambeti, “Bashikwiyisha.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Kotanjikata pakwinga nkanta nja kuli Bata. Nsombi koya wambile bakwetu, ubambileti, ndenga kuli Bata, kayi Ebameshenu, kuli Lesa wakame kayi endiye Lesa wenu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Maliya waku Magadalene walaya akwambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Ndamubono Mwami,” Neco walabambila byonse mbyalamwambila Mwami.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labonekelenga kuli beshikwiya bakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateyo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mansailo mpokwalashipa pabusuba bwa Sondo, Beshikwiya basa balikuba pamo. Bishinga byalikuba byacalwa, pakwinga balikutina bamakulene ba Bayuda. Lino Yesu walesa akwimana pakati pabo nekwambeti “Lumuno lube nenjamwe!” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco walababonesha makasa akendi ne kumbafu nkwalayaswa, neco beshikwiya basa balakondwa mpobalabona Mwami. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walambeti, “Lumuno lube nenu.” Mbuli Bata balantuma, nenjame ndamutumunga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi walabambila kayi walayoyela, “kamutambulani Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bantu abo mboshi mukalekelele bwipishi bwabo nibakalekelelwe cakubinga, nomba abo mboshi mukabule kulekelela nteshi bakalekelelwe sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Tomas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Umo wa basa beshikwiya balilikumi ne babili, Tomasi walikukwiweti mpundu, nkalikuba pamo ne beshikwiya banendi pacindi Yesu mpwalesa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya banendi basa balamwambila eti, “Afwe tulamubono Mwami.” Nsombi Tomasi walambeti, “Ndabula kubona bilonda bya misupikili, nambi kutyonka cimbombo cakame kumbafu nkwalayaswa nkandela kushoma sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mpopalapita masuba asanu ne atatu, beshikwiya basa balikuba munga'nda mopelomo ne Tomasi walikuba nabo. Bishinga byalikuba byacalwa, nsombi Yesu walesa, walemana pakati pabo nekwambeti, “Lumuno lube nenu!” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco, walambila Tomasi eti, “Tyonka cimbombo cakobe mumbafu mwakame, kayi bona makasa akame. Kobika cimbombo cakobe apa. Cileke kutonshanya kayi ushome.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tomasi walambeti, “Mwami wakame! Lesa wakame!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Sena ulashomo pacebo cakwambeti ulambono? bakute colwe balashomonga ncebatana babona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Libuku ili ncolyalabelako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu walensa bingashilo nabimbi bingi byeshikukankamanisha pamenso abeshikwiya bakendi, ibyo byabula kulembwa mulibuku ili. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nsombi ibi bilalembwe kwambeti mushometi Yesu eMupulushi Walaiwa usa, Mwanendi Lesa, kwambeti mwashoma mube ne buyumi butapu mulina lyakendi.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu labonekelenga kuli beshikwiya basanu ne babili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walalilesha kayi kuli beshikwiya bakendi kumulonga wa Tibeliyo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shimoni Petro, Tomasi ne Nataniele wa kumunshi waku Kana mucishi ca Galileya, bana basa ba Sebediya, kayi ne beshikwiya nabambi babili, balikuba pamo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shimoni Petulo walabambileti, “Ame ndenga akwikata inswi.” Nabo balambeti, “Nenjafwe tulenga nenjobe.” Balanyamuka nekuya akwingila mubwato. Nomba mashiku baliya kwikatapo inswi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca Yesu walemana pa mutunta. Nsombi beshikwiya basa nkabalenshibeti ni Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino nendi walabepusha eti, “Sena muliya kwikatapo inswi?” Nabo balambeti, “Sobwe, tulabwelekowa.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Walani kombe kulubasu lwakululyo kwa bwato, nimwikate.” Naboyo balawala kombe, nomba balalilwa kukwela kombe pakwinga kalekata inswi shingi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Popelapo shikwiya usa Yesu ngwalikusuna maningi walambila Petulo eti, “Ni Mwami!” Shimoni Petulo mpwalanyumfwa kwambeti ni mwami, walafwala mwinjila wakendi (pakwinga walikuba laufululu mwinjila) Nomba walaliwala mu lwenje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya nabambi basa balesa ne bwato kumutunta, nkabadonsa kombe kesula ne nswi shingi. Nkalikuba kutali ne mutunta, nsombi walikuba pepi ne ntamwa shakwana makumi asanu ne ana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpobalashika kumutunta balabona mulilo wa malasha kapali inswi ne shinkwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “kamuletani inswi shing'ana pali isho nshomulekata.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino Shimoni Petulo walengila mubwato musa nekukwelela kombe kumutunta, kalikuba kekata inswi shakwana mwanda ne makumi asanu ne shitatu. Nambi inswi shalafula mushobo uyu, kombe nkakalatwamuka sobwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Kamwisani mulye.” Nomba pa beshikwiya basa nkapalikuba nambi umo walaliyuminisha kumwipusheti, “Njobe bani?” Pakwinga balenshibeti ni Mwami. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu walaya akumanta buledi ne kubapa. Walensa copeleco ne nswi shisa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pacindi ici alakwana mankanda atatu akubonekela kuli beshikwiya bakendi kufuma mpalapunduka kubafu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mpobalapwisha kulya, Yesu walepusha Simoni Petulo eti, “Obe Shimoni mwanendi Yohane, sena unsuni kupita bonse aba?” Nendi walambeti, “Cakubinga Mwami, mucinshi kwambeti ndimusuni.” Yesu walamwambileti, “Sunga mbelele shakame.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu walamwipusha kayi katubili eti, “Obe Shimoni mwanendi Yohane, sena unsuni?” Nendi walambeti, “Cakubinga Mwami mucinsheti ndimusuni.” Yesu walamwambileti, “Sunga mbelele shakame.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu walamwipusha kayi kabutatu eti, “Obe Simoni mwanendi Yohane, sena unsuni?” Nendi walambeti, “Cakubinga Mwami mucinsheti ndimusuni.” Yesu walamwambileti, “Sunga mbelele shakame.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ndakwambilinga cakubinga, pacindi mpowalikuba mutuloba, walikulisunga wenka beloti nekuya kulikonse nkowalikwanda. Nomba wakacembela, nukatandabule makasa akobe kwambeti umbi akusunge beloti nekuya nenjobe nkotasuni.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>(Yesu walamba bintu ibi kwambeti abenshibishe moshi akafwile Petulo kwambeti Lesa akalemekwe. Mpalambeco, walambila Petulo eti, “Nkonke.”)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Petulo walacebuka nekubonowa shikwiya usa Yesu ngwalikwanda maningi nkamukonkela munyuma. Endiye shikwiya usa walikuba watamina pantiti pa Yesu Pacindi cakusekelela pasa nekumwipusheti, “Mwami weshi akamuyabe kubalwani benu nibani?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Popelapo Petulo walamubona nekumwipusheti, “Mwami, nomba uyu cilyeconi?” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Na ndandanga kwambeti nendi abe ne buyumi kushikila mpaka nkabwele, sena kuli obe ngaciba cani? Obe nkonke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino lulumbi lwalanyumfwika pakati pa beshikwiya bonse kwambeti usa munabo nteshi akafwe sobwe, nsombi walambeti, “Na ndandanga kwambeti nendi akabe ne buyumi mpaka nkabwele, sena kuli obe ngaciba cani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Uyu eweshikwiya usa walensa bukamboni bwa bintu byalenshika ibyo, kayi endiye walabilemba. Tucinshi kwambeti bukamboni bwakendi nibwakubinga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba kuli bintu nabimbi bingi Yesu mbyalensa. Nebyalalembwa byonse ibyo ndashoma kwambeti pacishi conse capanshi nepalakabulu mabuku akulembamo byonse ibyo.</para>
</usx>
